{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DnwiQEiubkXBtLtsoHkKAk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 调整为 \"DIF provides a complementary contamination signal\n2\t  with unique RL-robustness properties\"， 强调程度差异而非 binary 生存。Claim 2 从三信号降级为双信号 + DVD\n3\t  failure mode analysis。 Claim 3 限定为 within-subject equating pilot，讨论 acceptable degradation\n4\t  bounds。 核心叙事从 \"self-healing benchmark\" 转向 \"psychometric monitoring framework with\n5\t  contamination-aware recalibration\"。 需补充 2-3 个 ablation 实验填补 reviewer 攻击面。仍投 ICLR，但\n6\t  related work 和 limitation 需加厚。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n11\t  plan_id: plan_001\n12\t  description: '在 METABENCH MMLU 响应矩阵（5,055 models × 12,508 items）上执行 DIF 分析。 按 release\n13\t    date 划分 temporal cohorts（pre-2024 vs post-2024，以及更细的年度分割）。 对所有 items 运行 ETS C\n14\t    DIF 检测，以 MMLU-CF 为部分 ground truth 做交叉验证。\n15\t\n16\t    '\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    n_models_after_quality_filter: 4312\n19\t    n_items_analyzable: 11847\n20\t    cohort_pre2024_size: 2876\n21\t    cohort_post2024_size: 1436\n22\t    n_items_flagged_ets_c: 743\n23\t    pct_items_flagged: 0.0627\n24\t    dif_tpr_delta_ge_1.4_vs_mmlu_cf: 0.58\n25\t    dif_tpr_delta_ge_1.0: 0.41\n26\t    dif_fpr_clean_items: 0.062\n27\t    mmlu_cf_correlation_spearman: 0.21\n28\t    mmlu_cf_correlation_p_value: 0.003\n29\t    n_items_delta_ge_1.4_estimated: 187\n30\t    n_items_delta_1.0_to_1.4_estimated: 412\n31\t    n_items_delta_lt_1.0_estimated: 144\n32\t    ets_c_auc_vs_mmlu_cf_binary: 0.71\n33\t    sensitivity_cohort_split_annual_tpr_range: 0.52-0.63\n34\t    sensitivity_threshold_sweep_tpr_range: 0.44-0.67\n35\t  result_rationale: 'Simulation 在 N=100, δ=1.4 下得到 TPR=0.758，但真实数据有三个系统性降级因素： (1)\n36\t    真实 contamination effect sizes 不是均匀的 δ=1.4，多数 flagged items 落在 δ=1.0-1.4 的中间地带，\n37\t    拉低了 aggregate TPR；(2) METABENCH 数据的 model heterogeneity（不同架构、不同 training recipe）\n38\t    引入 DIF 分析假设之外的 noise，使得 IRT ability estimation 精度下降； (3) contamination 不是 binary\n39\t    uniform 的——部分 models 只接触了 partial benchmark subsets， 创造了 fuzzy group boundaries\n40\t    而非 simulation 中的 clean reference/focal split。 MMLU-CF correlation 为正但弱（ρ=0.21），因为\n41\t    MMLU-CF 的 modification 并非针对 DIF 设计—— 它改变了 item 内容以消除记忆优势，但有些 modification 也改变了\n42\t    difficulty， 引入了 false negatives（item 有 DIF 但 CF 版本 too different to count as same\n43\t    construct）。 FPR 从 simulation 的 0.036-0.042 升至 0.062，因为 real data 中存在 non-contamination\n44\t    来源的 DIF（如 certain model families 对特定 domain 有 architecture-driven advantages）。\n45\t    δ≥1.4 的 items 仅占 flagged items 的约 25%，大部分 contamination signal 在 medium effect\n46\t    区间。\n47\t\n48\t    '\n49\t  tables:\n50\t  - name: 'Table 1: DIF Detection Performance on MMLU by Effect Size Band'\n51\t    columns:\n52\t    - effect_size_band\n53\t    - n_items_estimated\n54\t    - ets_c_tpr\n55\t    - ets_c_fpr\n56\t    - mh_tpr\n57\t    - lr_tpr\n58\t    rows:\n59\t    - - δ ≥ 1.6\n60\t      - 68\n61\t      - 0.69\n62\t      - 0.058\n63\t      - 0.54\n64\t      - 0.61\n65\t    - - δ ∈ [1.4, 1.6)\n66\t      - 119\n67\t      - 0.52\n68\t      - 0.065\n69\t      - 0.38\n70\t      - 0.44\n71\t    - - δ ∈ [1.0, 1.4)\n72\t      - 412\n73\t      - 0.41\n74\t      - 0.063\n75\t      - 0.27\n76\t      - 0.33\n77\t    - - δ ∈ [0.6, 1.0)\n78\t      - 144\n79\t      - 0.18\n80\t      - 0.061\n81\t      - 0.11\n82\t      - 0.14\n83\t    - - Clean (no contamination evidence)\n84\t      - ~10400\n85\t      - —\n86\t      - 0.062\n87\t      - —\n88\t      - —\n89\t  - name: 'Table 2: Sensitivity to Cohort Definition'\n90\t    columns:\n91\t    - cohort_split\n92\t    - focal_n\n93\t    - reference_n\n94\t    - tpr_delta_ge_1.4\n95\t    - fpr\n96\t    - n_flagged\n97\t    rows:\n98\t    - - pre-2024 vs post-2024\n99\t      - 1436\n100\t      - 2876\n101\t      - 0.58\n102\t      - 0.062\n103\t      - 743\n104\t    - - pre-2023 vs post-2023\n105\t      - 1891\n106\t      - 2421\n107\t      - 0.54\n108\t      - 0.071\n109\t      - 812\n110\t    - - Annual (2022 vs 2024+)\n111\t      - 987\n112\t      - 1436\n113\t      - 0.63\n114\t      - 0.057\n115\t      - 691\n116\t    - - Quarterly (Q1-Q2 2023 vs Q3-Q4 2024)\n117\t      - 623\n118\t      - 718\n119\t      - 0.52\n120\t      - 0.084\n121\t      - 658\n122\t  - name: 'Table 3: MMLU-CF Cross-Validation'\n123\t    columns:\n124\t    - metric\n125\t    - value\n126\t    - 95% CI\n127\t    rows:\n128\t    - - Spearman ρ (DIF effect size vs CF accuracy gap)\n129\t      - 0.21\n130\t      - '[0.09, 0.33]'\n131\t    - - Items flagged by both DIF and CF\n132\t      - 47\n133\t      - —\n134\t    - - Items flagged by DIF only\n135\t      - 696\n136\t      - —\n137\t    - - Items flagged by CF only\n138\t      - 83\n139\t      - —\n140\t    - - Cohen's κ (binary agreement)\n141\t      - 0.14\n142\t      - '[0.06, 0.22]'\n143\t  figures_description:\n144\t  - 'Figure 1: Scatter plot — DIF effect size (Δ_MH) vs MMLU-CF accuracy gap per item.\n145\t    Weak positive trend (ρ=0.21) with substantial scatter. Color-coded by MMLU subject.\n146\t    STEM items cluster slightly tighter; humanities items show more dispersion. Annotation:\n147\t    items with high DIF but low CF gap likely reflect contamination patterns CF modification\n148\t    did not capture (e.g., partial memorization of distractor patterns).'\n149\t  - 'Figure 2: Histogram of estimated DIF effect sizes across all 12,508 items. Distribution\n150\t    is right-skewed with long tail. Vertical lines at δ=0.6, 1.0, 1.4 thresholds.\n151\t    Bulk of items (89%) below δ=0.6. Of flagged items, majority in δ=1.0-1.4 band,\n152\t    not the δ≥1.4 band where DIF has strongest power.'\n153\t  - 'Figure 3: ROC curves for DIF detection using MMLU-CF as noisy ground truth. ETS\n154\t    C achieves AUC=0.71, MH AUC=0.64, LR AUC=0.68. Note: AUC is suppressed by ground\n155\t    truth noise (CF ≠ perfect contamination label).'\n156\t  analysis: '核心发现：DIF 在真实数据上有统计显著的 contamination 信号，但 power 比 simulation 低约 12-18pp。\n157\t    主要瓶颈是 real contamination effect sizes 分布——δ≥1.4 的 items 仅占约 25%， 而 DIF 在 δ<1.0\n158\t    区间的 power 不足以独立检测。 MMLU-CF 交叉验证提供了 directional support（p=0.003）但 agreement 较低（κ=0.14），\n159\t    这既反映 DIF 的 imperfect power，也反映 CF 本身作为 ground truth 的局限性。 Cohort split sensitivity\n160\t    分析显示：focal group 越小，FPR 升高（quarterly split 达 0.084）， 建议使用年度或更粗的 cohort 划分。 对 Claim\n161\t    1 的影响：TPR=0.58 低于 paper framing 中承诺的 0.72-0.85 range， 需要将 claim 调整为 \"practical\n162\t    detection of large effects\" 并明确 medium effect 的 coverage gap。 这个 gap 恰好为 ensemble（Claim\n163\t    2）提供了动机。\n164\t\n165\t    '\n166\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n167\t  plan_id: plan_002\n168\t  description: '实证验证 DIF 的 RL-robustness。构建 SFT-only 和 SFT+RL 两种 cohort， 在两种场景下运行\n169\t    DIF 和传统 detectors，量化 RL 对各方法的影响。\n170\t\n171\t    '\n172\t  expected_results:\n173\t    n_rl_models_identified_in_metabench: 23\n174\t    n_rl_models_added_via_inference: 12\n175\t    total_rl_models: 35\n176\t    total_sft_only_models: 187\n177\t    dif_tpr_sft_cohort_delta_ge_1.4: 0.61\n178\t    dif_tpr_rl_cohort_delta_ge_1.4: 0.54\n179\t    dif_power_retention_ratio: 0.885\n180\t    mink_auroc_sft: 0.74\n181\t    mink_auroc_rl: 0.51\n182\t    mink_power_retention: 0.689\n183\t    constat_auroc_sft: 0.69\n184\t    constat_auroc_rl: 0.58\n185\t    constat_power_retention: 0.841\n186\t    dvd_auroc_sft: 0.62\n187\t    dvd_auroc_rl: 0.56\n188\t    dvd_power_retention: 0.903\n189\t    dif_vs_best_traditional_gap_under_rl: 0.08\n190\t    gpu_hours_used: 87\n191\t  result_rationale: 'DIF 的 power retention ratio (0.885) 高于传统方法平均值，但 gap 不如理论预期那么\n192\t    dramatic。 原因：(1) RL 训练确实平滑了 output distribution（Min-K% AUROC 从 0.74 降至 0.51， 与\n193\t    Wang et al. 的 14-20pp degradation 一致），但 DIF 也受到了轻微影响—— RL 不仅平滑 output，还改变了 response\n194\t    的 confidence calibration， 这通过 ability estimation 间接影响 DIF（IRT θ estimates 在 RL\n195\t    models 上 less stable）。 (2) 传统方法在 RL 下并未完全退化到 random：ConStat AUROC=0.58（不是 0.50），\n196\t    因为 perturbation sensitivity 虽然降低但未完全消失——RL 训练通常在 original format 上做 PPO， paraphrased\n197\t    items 仍能 trip up 部分 RL models。 DVD 在 RL 下 AUROC=0.56，看似 retention 高（0.903），但 baseline\n198\t    本身就低（0.62）， 说明 DVD 对这个 scenario 本身就不敏感而非 RL-robust。 最终 DIF vs best traditional\n199\t    的 gap（在 RL 下 DIF TPR=0.54 vs ConStat AUROC=0.58） 不是 \"DIF 独活\" 的故事，而是 \"DIF 保持了 reasonable\n200\t    power 且是 RL-robustness 最好的之一\"。 这要求将 narrative 从 \"only survivor\" 调整为 \"most robust\n201\t    complement\"。\n202\t\n203\t    '\n204\t  tables:\n205\t  - name: 'Table 4: Detection Power Under SFT vs RL Training'\n206\t    columns:\n207\t    - method\n208\t    - auroc_sft\n209\t    - auroc_rl\n210\t    - retention_ratio\n211\t    - Δ_auroc\n212\t    rows:\n213\t    - - DIF (ETS C)\n214\t      - 0.73\n215\t      - 0.68\n216\t      - 0.885\n217\t      - -0.05\n218\t    - - Min-K%\n219\t      - 0.74\n220\t      - 0.51\n221\t      - 0.689\n222\t      - -0.23\n223\t    - - Min-K%++\n224\t      - 0.71\n225\t      - 0.53\n226\t      - 0.746\n227\t      - -0.18\n228\t    - - ConStat (perturbation)\n229\t      - 0.69\n230\t      - 0.58\n231\t      - 0.841\n232\t      - -0.11\n233\t    - - DVD (generation variance)\n234\t      - 0.62\n235\t      - 0.56\n236\t      - 0.903\n237\t      - -0.06\n238\t    - - Perplexity ratio\n239\t      - 0.67\n240\t      - 0.49\n241\t      - 0.731\n242\t      - -0.18\n243\t    - - Zlib ratio\n244\t      - 0.59\n245\t      - 0.52\n246\t      - 0.881\n247\t      - -0.07\n248\t  - name: 'Table 5: DIF TPR Breakdown by RL Intensity'\n249\t    columns:\n250\t    - rl_category\n251\t    - n_models\n252\t    - dif_tpr_delta_ge_1.4\n253\t    - mink_auroc\n254\t    rows:\n255\t    - - SFT only\n256\t      - 187\n257\t      - 0.61\n258\t      - 0.74\n259\t    - - Light RL (< 200 steps)\n260\t      - 14\n261\t      - 0.57\n262\t      - 0.59\n263\t    - - Heavy RL (≥ 200 steps)\n264\t      - 21\n265\t      - 0.51\n266\t      - 0.47\n267\t  figures_description:\n268\t  - 'Figure 4: Grouped bar chart — AUROC by detection method, SFT vs RL cohorts. DIF\n269\t    shows smallest absolute drop. Min-K% shows largest. Error bars from bootstrap.\n270\t    Key visual: DIF bar heights nearly equal across groups; Min-K% and perplexity\n271\t    bars drop sharply in RL group.'\n272\t  - 'Figure 5: Power retention ratio plot — methods ranked by (AUROC_RL / AUROC_SFT).\n273\t    DIF ranks 2nd (0.885) after DVD (0.903), but DVD''s baseline is too low to be\n274\t    useful. Annotation: ''high retention on low baseline ≠ useful detection''.'\n275\t  - 'Figure 6: Scatter — DIF effect size vs Min-K% score per item, colored by model\n276\t    training type. SFT models show positive correlation; RL models show DIF signal\n277\t    persisting while Min-K% collapses toward uniform.'\n278\t  analysis: 'RL-robustness 存在但不 dramatic。DIF 的 retention ratio (0.885) 在所有方法中排名靠前，\n279\t    但 ConStat (0.841) 也保持了 reasonable power，DVD retention 高但 baseline 低。 Median tier\n280\t    下的故事不是 \"DIF 是唯一幸存者\"， 而是 \"DIF 提供了 RL-robust 且 complementary 的信号\"。 传统方法中 Min-K%\n281\t    退化最严重（AUROC 0.51，接近 random）， 这与 Wang et al. 一致——output-distribution-based 方法对\n282\t    RL 最脆弱。 但 performance-based 方法（ConStat）退化幅度小于预期。 Reviewer 可能攻击：(1) RL models 样本量小（n=35），统计\n283\t    power 有限； (2) \"RL intensity\" 是 proxy 而非精确度量。 需在 paper 中 acknowledge 这些 limitations\n284\t    并建议 future work 用 controlled RL fine-tuning 验证。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n288\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n289\t  description: '独立评估 ConStat-style perturbation testing 在 MMLU 上的 contamination 检测能力。\n290\t\n291\t    '\n292\t  expected_results:\n293\t    n_items_reformulated: 248\n294\t    n_models_tested: 42\n295\t    reformulation_semantic_similarity_mean: 0.91\n296\t    constat_tpr_non_rl_delta_ge_0.6: 0.47\n297\t    constat_tpr_non_rl_delta_ge_1.0: 0.58\n298\t    constat_tpr_non_rl_delta_ge_1.4: 0.64\n299\t    constat_tpr_rl_models_delta_ge_0.6: 0.23\n300\t    constat_tpr_rl_models_delta_ge_1.0: 0.31\n301\t    constat_fdr_controlled_alpha_0.05: 0.048\n302\t    constat_fdr_controlled_alpha_0.10: 0.087\n303\t    n_items_detected_fdr_0.10: 89\n304\t    overlap_with_dif_flags: 0.34\n305\t    gpu_hours_used: 72\n306\t  result_rationale: 'ConStat 在 non-RL models 上表现 reasonable（TPR=0.47 at δ≥0.6）， 因为\n307\t    perturbation sensitivity 是 memorization 的 direct signal—— memorized items 的 reformulated\n308\t    版本会导致 accuracy drop， 而 genuinely understood items 不会。这在 SFT models 上工作良好。 但 TPR\n309\t    未达到 ConStat 原论文 claimed 的水平，原因是： (1) MMLU 是 multiple-choice，perturbation space\n310\t    受限—— 改变 stem wording 可能改变 difficulty 而非仅测 memorization； (2) LLM reformulation\n311\t    质量不均匀，部分 paraphrases 引入了 subtle meaning shifts， 增加了 noise。在 RL models 上 TPR 下降到\n312\t    0.23（δ≥0.6）， 因为 RL 训练增强了 models 对 input perturbation 的 robustness（PPO reward hacking\n313\t    的副效应）， 使得 perturbation sensitivity 信号被 masked。 与 DIF flags 的 overlap 为 0.34——两种方法检测不同的\n314\t    contamination facets， DIF 捕捉 group-level behavioral shift，ConStat 捕捉 item-level\n315\t    perturbation sensitivity， 这正好支持 ensemble 的 complementarity 论点。\n316\t\n317\t    '\n318\t  tables:\n319\t  - name: 'Table 6: ConStat Detection Power by Effect Size and Model Type'\n320\t    columns:\n321\t    - effect_size_band\n322\t    - tpr_non_rl\n323\t    - tpr_rl\n324\t    - tpr_all_models\n325\t    rows:\n326\t    - - δ ≥ 1.4\n327\t      - 0.64\n328\t      - 0.31\n329\t      - 0.53\n330\t    - - δ ∈ [1.0, 1.4)\n331\t      - 0.58\n332\t      - 0.28\n333\t      - 0.48\n334\t    - - δ ∈ [0.6, 1.0)\n335\t      - 0.47\n336\t      - 0.23\n337\t      - 0.39\n338\t    - - δ < 0.6\n339\t      - 0.12\n340\t      - 0.08\n341\t      - 0.1\n342\t  - name: 'Table 7: ConStat vs DIF Signal Overlap Analysis'\n343\t    columns:\n344\t    - category\n345\t    - n_items\n346\t    - pct_of_flagged\n347\t    rows:\n348\t    - - Flagged by both DIF and ConStat\n349\t      - 31\n350\t      - 34%\n351\t    - - Flagged by DIF only\n352\t      - 58\n353\t      - 64%\n354\t    - - Flagged by ConStat only\n355\t      - 52\n356\t      - 57%\n357\t    - - Union (either method)\n358\t      - 141\n359\t      - —\n360\t  figures_description:\n361\t  - 'Figure 7: Venn diagram of DIF vs ConStat flagged items. Modest overlap (34%)\n362\t    demonstrates complementarity rather than redundancy. Annotated with examples:\n363\t    DIF-only items tend to be large-effect, RL-model-driven; ConStat-only items tend\n364\t    to be medium-effect, SFT-model-driven.'\n365\t  - 'Figure 8: ConStat detection power curve (TPR vs FDR threshold) for non-RL vs\n366\t    RL model subsets. Non-RL curve substantially above RL curve, visualizing the RL\n367\t    degradation. DIF power (horizontal reference line) shown for comparison.'\n368\t  analysis: 'ConStat 是 ensemble 中可用的第二个信号。它在 non-RL 场景下提供了 DIF 的 complementary coverage，\n369\t    尤其在 medium effect sizes（δ=0.6-1.4）——这恰好是 DIF 的 weak spot。 但 ConStat 在 RL 下 degradation\n370\t    明显（TPR 从 0.47 降至 0.23）， 形成了与 DIF 的互补关系：DIF RL-robust 但需大 effect sizes，ConStat\n371\t    覆盖 medium effects 但 RL-fragile。 两者 overlap 仅 34%，支持 ensemble 而非 redundancy。\n372\t\n373\t    '\n374\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n375\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n376\t  description: '独立评估 DVD generation variance 在 MMLU contamination detection 上的表现。\n377\t\n378\t    '\n379\t  expected_results:\n380\t    n_models_with_inference_access: 14\n381\t    n_items_tested: 248\n382\t    responses_per_item: 50\n383\t    dvd_tpr_variant_contamination: 0.38\n384\t    dvd_tpr_verbatim_contamination: 0.16\n385\t    dvd_tpr_non_variant_all: 0.19\n386\t    dvd_fpr: 0.094\n387\t    dvd_auroc_overall: 0.57\n388\t    bimodal_distribution_pct_items: 0.078\n389\t    generation_variance_mean_clean: 0.42\n390\t    generation_variance_mean_contaminated: 0.31\n391\t    generation_variance_separation_cohens_d: 0.38\n392\t    gpu_hours_used: 64\n393\t  result_rationale: 'DVD 在 median tier 下是表现最弱的信号，降级 ensemble 从 3-signal 到 2-signal\n394\t    的主要原因。 核心问题：MMLU 是 multiple-choice format，generation variance 的 signal 天然被压缩——\n395\t    即使 model 记忆了答案，其 generation 仍然只是 output 一个 letter (A/B/C/D)， variance 空间极为有限。DVD\n396\t    原设计针对 open-ended generation tasks， 在那里 memorized 内容会导致 deterministic long-form\n397\t    output（低 variance）， 但 MMLU 的 forced-choice format 使得这个信号几乎消失。 Variant contamination（model\n398\t    见过 rephrased version）确实产生了 slightly higher detection（TPR=0.38）， 因为 model 在 seen\n399\t    variants 上的 confidence distribution 有异常—— 但这个 TPR 仍然不足以作为 reliable signal。 Verbatim\n400\t    contamination 的 TPR 仅 0.16，因为 correct 答案的 generation variance 在 clean 和 contaminated\n401\t    items 之间差异太小（Cohen''s d=0.38）。 FPR=0.094 偏高，接近 actionable threshold。 这些结果表明 DVD\n402\t    在 MMLU-like benchmarks 上不适用， 但需在 paper 中分析 failure mode 并讨论其在 open-ended benchmarks\n403\t    上的 potential。\n404\t\n405\t    '\n406\t  tables:\n407\t  - name: 'Table 8: DVD Detection Performance on MMLU'\n408\t    columns:\n409\t    - contamination_type\n410\t    - n_items\n411\t    - tpr\n412\t    - auroc\n413\t    - cohen_d\n414\t    rows:\n415\t    - - Variant contamination\n416\t      - 34\n417\t      - 0.38\n418\t      - 0.62\n419\t      - 0.51\n420\t    - - Verbatim contamination\n421\t      - 89\n422\t      - 0.16\n423\t      - 0.54\n424\t      - 0.29\n425\t    - - Mixed/unknown\n426\t      - 125\n427\t      - 0.19\n428\t      - 0.57\n429\t      - 0.38\n430\t    - - Clean items\n431\t      - ~11600\n432\t      - —(FPR=0.094)\n433\t      - —\n434\t      - —\n435\t  - name: 'Table 9: Generation Variance Statistics'\n436\t    columns:\n437\t    - item_category\n438\t    - mean_variance\n439\t    - std\n440\t    - median\n441\t    rows:\n442\t    - - Clean items\n443\t      - 0.42\n444\t      - 0.18\n445\t      - 0.39\n446\t    - - Contaminated (verbatim)\n447\t      - 0.31\n448\t      - 0.21\n449\t      - 0.28\n450\t    - - Contaminated (variant)\n451\t      - 0.27\n452\t      - 0.19\n453\t      - 0.24\n454\t  figures_description:\n455\t  - 'Figure 9: Distribution of generation variance scores for clean vs contaminated\n456\t    items. Substantial overlap between distributions. Cohen''s d=0.38 indicates weak\n457\t    separation. Contrast with DIF effect size distribution (Figure 2) to motivate\n458\t    why DVD fails on multiple-choice format.'\n459\t  - 'Figure 10: Per-model variance heatmap (14 models × 248 items). No clear bimodal\n460\t    structure visible for most contaminated items. Bimodal pattern appears in only\n461\t    7.8% of items — insufficient for reliable detection.'\n462\t  analysis: 'DVD 是 ensemble 中 failed signal。Multiple-choice format 从根本上限制了 generation\n463\t    variance 的信息量。 这不是 DVD method 本身的缺陷，而是 application domain mismatch。 Paper 中需要：(1)\n464\t    清楚报告 DVD 的 failure 及 root cause analysis； (2) 讨论 DVD 可能在 open-ended benchmarks（如\n465\t    HumanEval、MATH with free-form answers）上有效； (3) 作为 ablation study 之一，分析 format\n466\t    dependence 对 detection signal 的影响。 这个 negative result 反而增强 paper 的 intellectual\n467\t    honesty，reviewer 会 appreciate  对 failure mode 的 transparent analysis 而非 cherry-picking。\n468\t\n469\t    '\n470\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n471\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n472\t  description: '将 DIF + ConStat 融合为双信号 ensemble（DVD 降级为 ablation analysis）。\n473\t\n474\t    '\n475\t  expected_results:\n476\t    ensemble_type: 2-signal (DIF + ConStat)\n477\t    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_1.4_all: 0.73\n478\t    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_1.0_all: 0.61\n479\t    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_0.6_all: 0.48\n480\t    ensemble_tpr_full_spectrum: 0.68\n481\t    ensemble_fpr: 0.082\n482\t    ensemble_tpr_rl_only_delta_ge_1.4: 0.59\n483\t    ensemble_tpr_non_rl_delta_ge_0.6: 0.55\n484\t    majority_voting_2of2_tpr: 0.34\n485\t    majority_voting_1of2_tpr: 0.79\n486\t    majority_voting_1of2_fpr: 0.11\n487\t    weighted_fusion_optimal_tpr: 0.73\n488\t    weighted_fusion_optimal_fpr: 0.082\n489\t    dif_weight_in_fusion: 0.58\n490\t    constat_weight_in_fusion: 0.42\n491\t    ablation_dif_only_tpr: 0.58\n492\t    ablation_constat_only_tpr: 0.47\n493\t    ablation_add_dvd_tpr_gain: 0.02\n494\t    coverage_analysis_dif_unique: 0.21\n495\t    coverage_analysis_constat_unique: 0.18\n496\t    coverage_analysis_overlap: 0.29\n497\t  result_rationale: '2-signal ensemble 通过 complementarity 实现了比任一单信号更好的 coverage： DIF\n498\t    覆盖 large effects + RL-robust，ConStat 覆盖 medium effects + non-RL， union coverage\n499\t    高于单独使用任一方法。 Weighted fusion（DIF 0.58, ConStat 0.42）优于 simple voting， 因为 DIF 的\n500\t    RL-robustness 使其在 mixed model population 中更 reliable。 2-of-2 voting 过于保守（TPR=0.34），因为两种方法检测的\n501\t    contamination facet 不同—— 要求两者同时 flag 等于取 intersection 而非 union。 1-of-2 voting\n502\t    FPR 偏高（0.11），因为 ConStat 的 FPR contribution。 Weighted fusion 在 TPR=0.73 / FPR=0.082\n503\t    处取得最佳平衡。 加入 DVD 仅带来 +0.02 TPR gain，不值得增加 pipeline 复杂度， 证实了 2-signal 降级的合理性。 Ensemble\n504\t    TPR=0.68（full spectrum）落在 median tier 指标范围 [0.6, 0.8] 内。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t  tables:\n508\t  - name: 'Table 10: Ensemble Fusion Strategy Comparison'\n509\t    columns:\n510\t    - strategy\n511\t    - tpr_δ≥1.4\n512\t    - tpr_δ≥0.6\n513\t    - fpr\n514\t    - f1\n515\t    rows:\n516\t    - - DIF only\n517\t      - 0.58\n518\t      - 0.38\n519\t      - 0.062\n520\t      - 0.47\n521\t    - - ConStat only\n522\t      - 0.64\n523\t      - 0.47\n524\t      - 0.087\n525\t      - 0.51\n526\t    - - 1-of-2 (union)\n527\t      - 0.79\n528\t      - 0.61\n529\t      - 0.11\n530\t      - 0.54\n531\t    - - 2-of-2 (intersection)\n532\t      - 0.34\n533\t      - 0.24\n534\t      - 0.031\n535\t      - 0.37\n536\t    - - Weighted fusion (optimal)\n537\t      - 0.73\n538\t      - 0.48\n539\t      - 0.082\n540\t      - 0.56\n541\t  - name: 'Table 11: Coverage Analysis — What Each Signal Uniquely Detects'\n542\t    columns:\n543\t    - scenario\n544\t    - dif_alone_detects\n545\t    - constat_alone_detects\n546\t    - both_detect\n547\t    - neither_detects\n548\t    rows:\n549\t    - - Large effect + RL model\n550\t      - ✓\n551\t      - ✗\n552\t      - —\n553\t      - —\n554\t    - - Medium effect + SFT model\n555\t      - ✗\n556\t      - ✓\n557\t      - —\n558\t      - —\n559\t    - - Large effect + SFT model\n560\t      - —\n561\t      - —\n562\t      - ✓\n563\t      - —\n564\t    - - Small effect (δ<0.6)\n565\t      - —\n566\t      - —\n567\t      - —\n568\t      - ✓\n569\t  - name: 'Table 12: Ablation — Value of Each Signal in Ensemble'\n570\t    columns:\n571\t    - configuration\n572\t    - tpr_full_spectrum\n573\t    - Δ_vs_full_ensemble\n574\t    rows:\n575\t    - - DIF + ConStat (full)\n576\t      - 0.68\n577\t      - baseline\n578\t    - - DIF only\n579\t      - 0.58\n580\t      - -0.1\n581\t    - - ConStat only\n582\t      - 0.47\n583\t      - -0.21\n584\t    - - DIF + ConStat + DVD\n585\t      - 0.7\n586\t      - 0.02\n587\t  figures_description:\n588\t  - 'Figure 11: Coverage heatmap — rows are (effect size band × model type) cells,\n589\t    columns are detection methods. Color intensity = TPR in that cell. Shows DIF strong\n590\t    in upper-right (large effect, RL), ConStat strong in middle-left (medium effect,\n591\t    SFT), both weak in lower region (small effects). Ensemble union covers more cells\n592\t    than either alone.'\n593\t  - 'Figure 12: Precision-Recall curves for single-signal vs ensemble approaches.\n594\t    Ensemble curve dominates both individual curves, especially in the 0.4-0.7 recall\n595\t    range where complementarity adds most value.'\n596\t  - 'Figure 13: Ablation bar chart — TPR contribution of adding each signal. DIF→DIF+ConStat:\n597\t    +0.10. DIF+ConStat→+DVD: +0.02. Diminishing returns visualized; motivates 2-signal\n598\t    design choice.'\n599\t  analysis: '2-signal ensemble 在 median tier 下是 pragmatic best result： full spectrum\n600\t    TPR=0.68 说明 coverage 有显著 gaps（尤其 small effects + RL）， 但比任一单信号提升 10-21pp。 Paper\n601\t    narrative 需强调 complementarity mechanism 而非 absolute performance， 并 honestly 报告\n602\t    coverage holes。 DVD ablation 提供了 principled argument for 2-signal design， 同时 DVD\n603\t    failure analysis 作为 Section 5.3 的 content。 Reviewer concern：FPR=0.082 接近 0.10\n604\t    boundary，需讨论 false alarm cost 和 threshold tuning。\n605\t\n606\t    '\n607\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n608\t  plan_id: plan_004\n609\t  description: '在 GSM8K 上复制 DIF 分析，使用 GSM1K 作为 contamination ground truth。\n610\t\n611\t    '\n612\t  expected_results:\n613\t    n_models_gsm8k: 68\n614\t    n_items_gsm8k: 1319\n615\t    n_items_gsm1k: 1250\n616\t    cohort_split: pre-2024 vs post-2024\n617\t    focal_n: 31\n618\t    reference_n: 37\n619\t    n_items_dif_flagged_gsm8k: 127\n620\t    pct_items_flagged_gsm8k: 0.096\n621\t    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_mean_all_models: 0.073\n622\t    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_mean_flagged_models: 0.118\n623\t    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_dif_correlation: 0.22\n624\t    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_correlation_p_value: 0.014\n625\t    dif_tpr_vs_gsm1k_proxy: 0.49\n626\t    dif_fpr_vs_gsm1k_proxy: 0.071\n627\t    per_model_dif_flag_count_vs_gap_r: 0.31\n628\t    gpu_hours_used: 83\n629\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K 上的 DIF 分析面临更大挑战：(1) model sample size 更小（N=68 vs MMLU 的\n630\t    4312）， 直接降低 statistical power；(2) GSM8K 是 math reasoning 而非 factual recall， contamination\n631\t    pattern 不同——models 可能记忆了 solution patterns 而非 specific items， DIF 对 pattern-level\n632\t    contamination 不如 item-level 敏感。 GSM8K-GSM1K gap correlation (ρ=0.22, p=0.014)\n633\t    提供了独立验证 DIF 有 contamination 信号的证据， 但 correlation 弱于 MMLU-CF（ρ=0.21 对 ρ=0.22 看似接近，但\n634\t    GSM1K 是更 clean 的 ground truth）， 反映了 math reasoning benchmark 上 contamination 形态的不同。\n635\t    Per-model analysis（每个 model 被 flag 的 item count vs 其 GSM8K-GSM1K gap，r=0.31） 比\n636\t    item-level correlation 更强，说明 DIF 在 model-level 上更有 discriminative power。 TPR=0.49\n637\t    低于 MMLU 的 0.58，主要因为 sample size 和 effect size distribution 差异。\n638\t\n639\t    '\n640\t  tables:\n641\t  - name: 'Table 13: GSM8K DIF Results Summary'\n642\t    columns:\n643\t    - metric\n644\t    - value\n645\t    - 95% CI\n646\t    rows:\n647\t    - - Items flagged by DIF\n648\t      - 127\n649\t      - —\n650\t    - - Mean GSM8K-GSM1K gap (all models)\n651\t      - 7.3%\n652\t      - '[5.1%, 9.5%]'\n653\t    - - Mean gap (high DIF-flag-count models)\n654\t      - 11.8%\n655\t      - '[8.2%, 15.4%]'\n656\t    - - Item-level DIF-gap correlation (ρ)\n657\t      - 0.22\n658\t      - '[0.06, 0.37]'\n659\t    - - Model-level flag-count-gap correlation (r)\n660\t      - 0.31\n661\t      - '[0.14, 0.47]'\n662\t  - name: 'Table 14: Cross-Benchmark Comparison'\n663\t    columns:\n664\t    - benchmark\n665\t    - n_models\n666\t    - n_items\n667\t    - dif_tpr\n668\t    - ground_truth_correlation\n669\t    - fpr\n670\t    rows:\n671\t    - - MMLU\n672\t      - 4312\n673\t      - 11847\n674\t      - 0.58\n675\t      - ρ=0.21 (MMLU-CF)\n676\t      - 0.062\n677\t    - - GSM8K\n678\t      - 68\n679\t      - 1319\n680\t      - 0.49\n681\t      - ρ=0.22 (GSM1K)\n682\t      - 0.071\n683\t  figures_description:\n684\t  - 'Figure 14: Scatter — per-model DIF flag count vs GSM8K-GSM1K accuracy gap. Positive\n685\t    trend (r=0.31) with high variance. Models with >15 flagged items tend to have\n686\t    larger gaps. Outliers annotated: some models with large gaps but few DIF flags\n687\t    (pattern-level contamination DIF misses).'\n688\t  - 'Figure 15: Side-by-side DIF effect size distributions for MMLU and GSM8K. GSM8K\n689\t    distribution shifted left (smaller effects on average), consistent with math reasoning\n690\t    contamination being subtler than factual knowledge contamination.'\n691\t  analysis: 'GSM8K 结果提供了 complementary 但非 decisive 的验证。 ρ=0.22 是 statistically significant\n692\t    但 practically weak 的 correlation。 主要价值是证明 DIF 在不同 benchmark domain（factual vs\n693\t    reasoning）上都有 signal， 但 power 更低。Paper 中需讨论 math reasoning benchmarks 上 contamination\n694\t    形态不同 （pattern memorization vs item memorization）作为 DIF power 下降的 explanation。\n695\t    这个实验作为 supporting evidence 而非 standalone result。\n696\t\n697\t    '\n698\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n699\t  plan_id: plan_005\n700\t  description: '在 MMLU 上 pilot bifactor IRT equating：拟合 bifactor model，选择 anchor items，\n701\t    通过 fixed-parameter calibration 校准 replacement items。\n702\t\n703\t    '\n704\t  expected_results:\n705\t    bifactor_model_converged: true\n706\t    n_general_factor_loadings_gt_0.3: 9847\n707\t    n_subject_factors: 57\n708\t    subject_factor_variance_explained_range: 0.04-0.18\n709\t    general_factor_variance_explained: 0.41\n710\t    n_anchor_items_selected: 2340\n711\t    anchor_item_dif_stability: 0.96\n712\t    within_subject_equating_spearman_rho_mean: 0.93\n713\t    within_subject_equating_rho_range: 0.89-0.97\n714\t    cross_subject_equating_spearman_rho: 0.87\n715\t    cross_subject_factor_instability_pct: 0.23\n716\t    score_reliability_original: 0.89\n717\t    score_reliability_equated_5pct_replaced: 0.87\n718\t    score_reliability_equated_20pct_replaced: 0.82\n719\t    equating_bias_mean: 0.003\n720\t    equating_rmse: 0.047\n721\t  result_rationale: 'Bifactor model 在 MMLU 上 converges 但 reveals structural heterogeneity：\n722\t    general factor 仅解释 41% variance（低于典型 educational test 的 50-60%）， 因为 MMLU 覆盖 57\n723\t    个 diverse subjects，跨 subject variance 大。 Within-subject equating 表现良好（mean ρ=0.93），因为\n724\t    same-subject items 共享 factor structure， anchor items 稳定性高（stability=0.96）。 但 cross-subject\n725\t    equating（ρ=0.87）低于 within-subject，因为 23% 的 subjects 的 factor structure 在不同 model\n726\t    cohorts 间不稳定—— 即 model evolution 不仅改变了 ability level，也改变了 ability structure （某些\n727\t    model families 在 STEM 上进步远快于 humanities）， violating bifactor model 的 factorial\n728\t    invariance 假设。 ρ=0.93 在 within-subject 内可行但 ρ=0.87 cross-subject 不足以支持 \"全 benchmark\n729\t    等值\" 的 claim。 这迫使 Claim 3 限定 scope 为 within-subject equating pilot。 Progressive\n730\t    replacement 分析显示 5% 替换下 reliability 可接受（0.87）， 但 20% 替换时 reliability 降至 0.82，接近\n731\t    practical minimum。\n732\t\n733\t    '\n734\t  tables:\n735\t  - name: 'Table 15: Bifactor Model Fit Statistics'\n736\t    columns:\n737\t    - metric\n738\t    - value\n739\t    rows:\n740\t    - - General factor variance explained\n741\t      - 0.41\n742\t    - - Mean subject-factor variance\n743\t      - 0.09\n744\t    - - RMSEA\n745\t      - 0.038\n746\t    - - CFI\n747\t      - 0.94\n748\t    - - TLI\n749\t      - 0.92\n750\t    - - Subjects with stable factor structure\n751\t      - 44/57 (77%)\n752\t  - name: 'Table 16: Equating Performance by Scope'\n753\t    columns:\n754\t    - scope\n755\t    - spearman_rho\n756\t    - equating_bias\n757\t    - rmse\n758\t    - n_items_replaced\n759\t    rows:\n760\t    - - Within-subject (STEM avg)\n761\t      - 0.95\n762\t      - 0.002\n763\t      - 0.038\n764\t      - 47\n765\t    - - Within-subject (Humanities avg)\n766\t      - 0.91\n767\t      - 0.004\n768\t      - 0.052\n769\t      - 39\n770\t    - - Within-subject (overall)\n771\t      - 0.93\n772\t      - 0.003\n773\t      - 0.047\n774\t      - 86\n775\t    - - Cross-subject (full MMLU)\n776\t      - 0.87\n777\t      - 0.011\n778\t      - 0.073\n779\t      - 86\n780\t  - name: 'Table 17: Score Reliability Under Progressive Replacement'\n781\t    columns:\n782\t    - pct_items_replaced\n783\t    - reliability_α\n784\t    - ranking_τ\n785\t    - rho\n786\t    rows:\n787\t    - - 0% (baseline)\n788\t      - 0.89\n789\t      - 1.0\n790\t      - 1.0\n791\t    - - 5%\n792\t      - 0.87\n793\t      - 0.98\n794\t      - 0.97\n795\t    - - 10%\n796\t      - 0.85\n797\t      - 0.96\n798\t      - 0.95\n799\t    - - 20%\n800\t      - 0.82\n801\t      - 0.93\n802\t      - 0.91\n803\t    - - 50%\n804\t      - 0.74\n805\t      - 0.84\n806\t      - 0.82\n807\t  figures_description:\n808\t  - 'Figure 16: Within-subject equating scatter plots for 4 representative subjects.\n809\t    Original vs equated model rankings. STEM subjects (physics, CS) show tighter fit;\n810\t    humanities subjects (philosophy, history) show more scatter.'\n811\t  - 'Figure 17: Reliability degradation curve — score reliability (Cronbach''s α equivalent)\n812\t    vs percentage of items replaced. Horizontal dashed line at α=0.80 (acceptable\n813\t    threshold). Crosses threshold between 20-30% replacement, suggesting practical\n814\t    upper bound.'\n815\t  - 'Figure 18: Subject-level factor stability analysis. Heatmap of factor loading\n816\t    correlations across cohorts per subject. 23% of subjects show loading correlation\n817\t    < 0.85, indicating structural instability.'\n818\t  analysis: 'Within-subject equating 是 viable（ρ=0.93），但 cross-subject 不稳定（ρ=0.87）\n819\t    限制了 full-benchmark equating 的 claim。 Paper 中需要：(1) 明确 scope 限制——Claim 3 rewrite\n820\t    为 \"within-subject equating pilot\"； (2) 讨论 factor instability 的 root cause（model\n821\t    capability evolution 非 uniform across domains）； (3) 提出 subject-specific equating\n822\t    作为 practical deployment strategy。 Progressive replacement 结果提供了 practical guideline：5-10%\n823\t    替换安全，20% 是 borderline， 50% 不可接受。这是有用的 contribution 即使 full equating 不完美。\n824\t\n825\t    '\n826\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n827\t  plan_id: plan_006\n828\t  description: '为 DIF-flagged 的 MMLU items 生成替换 items，通过 student simulation 校准 difficulty。\n829\t\n830\t    '\n831\t  expected_results:\n832\t    n_items_generated: 150\n833\t    n_items_passing_quality_filter: 118\n834\t    quality_filter_pass_rate: 0.787\n835\t    difficulty_rho_prompt_based: 0.32\n836\t    difficulty_rho_student_sim: 0.63\n837\t    difficulty_rho_student_sim_within_subject: 0.68\n838\t    discrimination_correlation: 0.41\n839\t    construct_validity_factor_loading_mean: 0.38\n840\t    construct_validity_factor_loading_original_mean: 0.47\n841\t    difficulty_mae_prompt_based: 0.34\n842\t    difficulty_mae_student_sim: 0.19\n843\t    n_items_within_0.5_logit_of_target: 74\n844\t    pct_items_within_0.5_logit: 0.627\n845\t    gpu_hours_used: 178\n846\t  result_rationale: 'Student simulation calibration（ρ=0.63）显著优于 prompt-based targeting（ρ=0.32），\n847\t    因为 student simulation 通过实际 \"model population\" 响应来 estimate difficulty， 绕过了 LLM\n848\t    self-assessment 的 calibration 问题。 但 ρ=0.63 低于 arXiv 2601.09953 reported 的 r=0.75-0.82，原因有二：\n849\t    (1) 那篇论文的 evaluation 是 within-domain（同类型题目）， 而这里的 generated items 跨越了 57 subjects，domain\n850\t    diversity 降低了 aggregate correlation； (2) MMLU items 的 difficulty 部分来自 distractor\n851\t    quality， LLM generation 的 distractors 往往不如 human-crafted 的 effective， 导致 generated\n852\t    items systematically easier（difficulty MAE=0.19 with slight easy-bias）。 Within-subject\n853\t    ρ=0.68 高于 overall 的 0.63，说明 domain-specific generation 更 reliable。 Construct validity\n854\t    是 soft spot：generated items 的 factor loadings（mean=0.38） 低于 original items（0.47），表明\n855\t    generated items 与 underlying construct 的 alignment 较弱。 这 limits claim 强度——replacement\n856\t    items 在 difficulty 上校准 acceptable， 但 construct validity 有 degradation。\n857\t\n858\t    '\n859\t  tables:\n860\t  - name: 'Table 18: Difficulty Calibration Comparison'\n861\t    columns:\n862\t    - method\n863\t    - ρ_overall\n864\t    - ρ_within_subject\n865\t    - mae\n866\t    - n_within_0.5_logit\n867\t    rows:\n868\t    - - Prompt-based targeting\n869\t      - 0.32\n870\t      - 0.39\n871\t      - 0.34\n872\t      - 41/118 (35%)\n873\t    - - Student simulation\n874\t      - 0.63\n875\t      - 0.68\n876\t      - 0.19\n877\t      - 74/118 (63%)\n878\t    - - Student sim + iterative refinement\n879\t      - 0.66\n880\t      - 0.71\n881\t      - 0.17\n882\t      - 79/118 (67%)\n883\t  - name: 'Table 19: Generated Item Quality Metrics'\n884\t    columns:\n885\t    - metric\n886\t    - generated_items\n887\t    - original_items\n888\t    - gap\n889\t    rows:\n890\t    - - Mean difficulty (IRT b)\n891\t      - -0.62\n892\t      - -0.84\n893\t      - +0.22 (easier)\n894\t    - - Mean discrimination (IRT a)\n895\t      - 0.93\n896\t      - 1.2\n897\t      - '-0.27'\n898\t    - - Factor loading (general)\n899\t      - 0.38\n900\t      - 0.47\n901\t      - '-0.09'\n902\t    - - Distractor effectiveness\n903\t      - 0.61\n904\t      - 0.78\n905\t      - '-0.17'\n906\t  figures_description:\n907\t  - 'Figure 19: Scatter — target difficulty (from DIF-flagged original item) vs achieved\n908\t    difficulty (student simulation estimate). Prompt-based (left panel, ρ=0.32) vs\n909\t    student sim (right panel, ρ=0.63). Student sim shows tighter fit with systematic\n910\t    easy-bias visible as regression line below identity.'\n911\t  - 'Figure 20: Histogram of difficulty calibration errors (|b_target - b_achieved|).\n912\t    Student sim distribution shifted left relative to prompt-based. 63% of student\n913\t    sim items within 0.5 logit of target (vs 35% for prompt-based).'\n914\t  analysis: 'Student simulation calibration 是 viable 但 imperfect 的 difficulty estimation\n915\t    method。 ρ=0.63 的 practical implication：about 2/3 of items 在 acceptable difficulty\n916\t    range 内， 足够 support \"empirical calibration dramatically outperforms prompt-based\"\n917\t    的 claim， 但不足以 claim \"precise psychometric replacement\"。 Construct validity gap（factor\n918\t    loading 0.38 vs 0.47）是 paper 需要 honestly address 的 limitation—— generated items\n919\t    测量了 approximately same construct 但不 identical。 Combined with equating results\n920\t    (plan_005)，Claim 3 的叙事应为 \"pilot demonstration of calibrated regeneration with\n921\t    known quality bounds\"。\n922\t\n923\t    '\n924\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n925\t  plan_id: plan_007\n926\t  description: '实现 cumulative Bayesian DIF priors，模拟 4 次连续 benchmark administrations，\n927\t    展示 evidence accumulation 带来的 power improvement。\n928\t\n929\t    '\n930\t  expected_results:\n931\t    n_administrations_simulated: 4\n932\t    n_models_per_administration: 80\n933\t    power_admin_1_medium_delta_1.0: 0.33\n934\t    power_admin_2_cumulative: 0.48\n935\t    power_admin_3_cumulative: 0.59\n936\t    power_admin_4_cumulative: 0.66\n937\t    power_admin_1_large_delta_1.4: 0.55\n938\t    power_admin_4_large_delta_1.4_cumulative: 0.78\n939\t    false_positive_rate_cumulative: 0.053\n940\t    bayes_factor_threshold: 3.0\n941\t    pct_items_reaching_bf_threshold_by_admin_4: 0.71\n942\t  result_rationale: 'Bayesian accumulation 从 real-data 的 lower baseline 开始（而非 simulation\n943\t    的 higher baseline）， 所以 single administration power 为 0.33（medium effect），低于 simulation\n944\t    的 ~0.40。 但 accumulation dynamic 仍然 works：每次 administration 增加约 0.10-0.15 power，\n945\t    到第 4 次达到 0.66——接近但未达到 simulation 预期的 0.70。 Gap 来自 real data 的 prior mis-specification：Bayesian\n946\t    prior 假设 DIF effects  follow specific distribution，但真实 contamination 的 temporal\n947\t    dynamics 不 stationary （某些 items 的 contamination 随时间变化，violating prior assumptions）。\n948\t    FPR 保持在 0.053，说明 Bayesian framework 的 false alarm control 合理。 For large effects（δ=1.4），cumulative\n949\t    power 达到 0.78（4 administrations）， 这是 paper 中值得 highlight 的 positive result——说明\n950\t    \"patience pays off\"。\n951\t\n952\t    '\n953\t  tables:\n954\t  - name: 'Table 20: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power Over Successive Administrations'\n955\t    columns:\n956\t    - administration\n957\t    - n_models_cumulative\n958\t    - power_δ=1.0\n959\t    - power_δ=1.4\n960\t    - fpr\n961\t    rows:\n962\t    - - '1'\n963\t      - 80\n964\t      - 0.33\n965\t      - 0.55\n966\t      - 0.048\n967\t    - - '2'\n968\t      - 160\n969\t      - 0.48\n970\t      - 0.67\n971\t      - 0.051\n972\t    - - '3'\n973\t      - 240\n974\t      - 0.59\n975\t      - 0.74\n976\t      - 0.052\n977\t    - - '4'\n978\t      - 320\n979\t      - 0.66\n980\t      - 0.78\n981\t      - 0.053\n982\t  figures_description:\n983\t  - 'Figure 21: Power accumulation curves — TPR vs number of administrations for δ=1.0\n984\t    and δ=1.4. Both curves show diminishing-returns concave shape. δ=1.4 curve crosses\n985\t    0.70 threshold by administration 3; δ=1.0 curve approaches but doesn''t reach\n986\t    0.70 by administration 4. Extrapolation (dashed) suggests ~6 administrations needed\n987\t    for δ=1.0 to reach 0.70.'\n988\t  analysis: 'Bayesian accumulation 是 DIF power 不足问题的 temporal solution。 核心 message：单次检测\n989\t    power 有限（0.33-0.55），但 monitoring framework  通过时间积累达到 useful power（0.66-0.78 at\n990\t    4 administrations）。 这 directly supports \"psychometric monitoring framework\" 的\n991\t    narrative reframing—— 不是 one-shot detection 而是 continuous monitoring。 但需要注意 practical\n992\t    caveat：4 administrations 可能需要 1-2 年， 在此期间 contamination 已经对 benchmark validity\n993\t    造成了 damage。\n994\t\n995\t    '\n996\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n997\t  plan_id: plan_008\n998\t  description: '分析 benchmark validity 在 progressive item replacement 下的 graceful degradation。\n999\t\n1000\t    '\n1001\t  expected_results:\n1002\t    replacement_rates_tested:\n1003\t    - 0.05\n1004\t    - 0.1\n1005\t    - 0.15\n1006\t    - 0.2\n1007\t    - 0.3\n1008\t    - 0.5\n1009\t    ranking_stability_kendall_tau_5pct: 0.97\n1010\t    ranking_stability_kendall_tau_10pct: 0.95\n1011\t    ranking_stability_kendall_tau_20pct: 0.91\n1012\t    ranking_stability_kendall_tau_50pct: 0.81\n1013\t    score_reliability_cronbach_5pct: 0.87\n1014\t    score_reliability_cronbach_10pct: 0.85\n1015\t    score_reliability_cronbach_20pct: 0.82\n1016\t    score_reliability_cronbach_50pct: 0.74\n1017\t    construct_coverage_jaccard_5pct: 0.97\n1018\t    construct_coverage_jaccard_20pct: 0.89\n1019\t    construct_coverage_jaccard_50pct: 0.76\n1020\t    theoretical_upper_bound_replacement_rate: 0.25\n1021\t    practical_recommended_max: 0.15\n1022\t    equating_error_propagation_rmse_10pct: 0.041\n1023\t    equating_error_propagation_rmse_20pct: 0.068\n1024\t  result_rationale: 'Graceful degradation 分析显示 benchmark validity 在 low replacement\n1025\t    rates 下 well-preserved， 但在 >20% 时快速衰退。这符合 psychometric theory：test reliability\n1026\t    近似为 Spearman-Brown 函数， each replaced item 引入 calibration error（plan_006 显示 difficulty\n1027\t    ρ=0.63）， error 随 replacement rate 线性累积但 validity impact 呈 nonlinear degradation。\n1028\t    15% replacement 是 practical sweet spot：ranking stability (τ=0.93) 和 reliability\n1029\t    (α=0.84)  都在 acceptable range，且涵盖了 plan_001 中约 80% 的 δ≥1.0 flagged items。 50%\n1030\t    replacement 的 reliability 降至 0.74，低于 psychometric 标准的 0.80 threshold—— 这是 \"benchmark\n1031\t    不再可比\" 的 hard boundary。 Theoretical analysis 给出 upper bound 25%（在 perfect calibration\n1032\t    假设下）， 但 plan_006 的 imperfect calibration 将实际 limit 压到 15%。\n1033\t\n1034\t    '\n1035\t  tables:\n1036\t  - name: 'Table 21: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n1037\t    columns:\n1038\t    - replacement_rate\n1039\t    - kendall_τ\n1040\t    - cronbach_α\n1041\t    - construct_jaccard\n1042\t    - equating_rmse\n1043\t    rows:\n1044\t    - - 0% (baseline)\n1045\t      - 1.0\n1046\t      - 0.89\n1047\t      - 1.0\n1048\t      - 0.0\n1049\t    - - 5%\n1050\t      - 0.97\n1051\t      - 0.87\n1052\t      - 0.97\n1053\t      - 0.029\n1054\t    - - 10%\n1055\t      - 0.95\n1056\t      - 0.85\n1057\t      - 0.94\n1058\t      - 0.041\n1059\t    - - 15%\n1060\t      - 0.93\n1061\t      - 0.84\n1062\t      - 0.91\n1063\t      - 0.054\n1064\t    - - 20%\n1065\t      - 0.91\n1066\t      - 0.82\n1067\t      - 0.89\n1068\t      - 0.068\n1069\t    - - 30%\n1070\t      - 0.87\n1071\t      - 0.78\n1072\t      - 0.83\n1073\t      - 0.091\n1074\t    - - 50%\n1075\t      - 0.81\n1076\t      - 0.74\n1077\t      - 0.76\n1078\t      - 0.132\n1079\t  figures_description:\n1080\t  - 'Figure 22: Multi-panel degradation curves — kendall τ, cronbach α, construct\n1081\t    coverage vs replacement rate. All three metrics show concave degradation pattern.\n1082\t    Shaded regions indicate ''safe'' (<15%), ''caution'' (15-25%), and ''unacceptable''\n1083\t    (>25%) zones. Vertical dashed lines at 15% (practical) and 25% (theoretical) bounds.'\n1084\t  - 'Figure 23: Equating error propagation — RMSE of equated scores vs replacement\n1085\t    rate. Near-linear growth up to 20%, then acceleration. Error bars from bootstrap\n1086\t    (100 resamples).'\n1087\t  analysis: 'This experiment 提供了 Claim 3 最重要的 practical guideline： up to 15% item\n1088\t    replacement 维持 acceptable validity，这足以处理大部分 contamination。 Paper 应将此 frame 为 \"known\n1089\t    operating envelope\" 而非 limitation—— psychometric maturity 在于知道方法的 validity bounds，而非声称无限\n1090\t    scalability。 Theoretical vs practical bound gap（25% vs 15%）由 item generation quality\n1091\t    驱动， 指向 future work：improve generation quality → expand operating envelope。\n1092\t\n1093\t    '\n1094\t- name: item_focused_trees\n1095\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1096\t  description: '实现 Item-Focused Trees 作为 categorical cohort DIF 的替代方案， 将 model release\n1097\t    date 作为连续 covariate。\n1098\t\n1099\t    '\n1100\t  expected_results:\n1101\t    n_items_analyzed: 11847\n1102\t    n_items_significant_ift: 891\n1103\t    ift_tpr_delta_ge_1.4: 0.62\n1104\t    ift_tpr_delta_ge_1.0: 0.46\n1105\t    ift_fpr: 0.058\n1106\t    ift_vs_ets_c_tpr_gain: 0.04\n1107\t    ift_vs_ets_c_fpr_reduction: 0.004\n1108\t    ift_detected_gradual_contamination_items: 134\n1109\t    ift_split_point_mode_month: 2023-09\n1110\t    ift_computational_time_minutes: 47\n1111\t  result_rationale: 'Item-Focused Trees 提供了 modest improvement over categorical DIF（TPR\n1112\t    +0.04, FPR -0.004）， 因为它避免了 arbitrary cohort splits 导致的 information loss—— 连续 covariate\n1113\t    保留了 release date 的 full ordering information。 但 improvement 幅度有限，因为 contamination\n1114\t    在时间上确实是 roughly step-function-like （一旦 benchmark 被 widely available，contamination\n1115\t    快速 saturates）， 使得 continuous treatment 的 marginal benefit 小。 IFT 的独特贡献是发现了 134\n1116\t    个 \"gradual contamination\" items—— 这些 items 的 DIF effect size 随时间平滑增长而非 suddenly\n1117\t    appear， 对应 incremental leakage pattern。这在 categorical DIF 中不可见。 Split point mode\n1118\t    在 2023-09，大致对应 MMLU 进入 mainstream LLM training data 的时间点。\n1119\t\n1120\t    '\n1121\t  tables:\n1122\t  - name: 'Table 22: IFT vs Categorical DIF Comparison'\n1123\t    columns:\n1124\t    - method\n1125\t    - tpr_δ≥1.4\n1126\t    - tpr_δ≥1.0\n1127\t    - fpr\n1128\t    - unique_detections\n1129\t    rows:\n1130\t    - - ETS C (categorical)\n1131\t      - 0.58\n1132\t      - 0.41\n1133\t      - 0.062\n1134\t      - 47\n1135\t    - - IFT (continuous)\n1136\t      - 0.62\n1137\t      - 0.46\n1138\t      - 0.058\n1139\t      - 134\n1140\t    - - Overlap (both detect)\n1141\t      - —\n1142\t      - —\n1143\t      - —\n1144\t      - 612\n1145\t  figures_description:\n1146\t  - 'Figure 24: Item-level contamination onset timeline. X-axis: model release date.\n1147\t    Y-axis: IFT-estimated DIF effect size. Each line represents one item. Most items\n1148\t    show step-function pattern (sudden onset); 134 items show gradual ramp (linear\n1149\t    increase). Vertical dashed line at 2023-09.'\n1150\t  analysis: IFT 是 useful methodological extension 但非 game-changer。 Paper 中作为 robustness\n1151\t    check 和 methodological contribution（Section 4.x）。 Gradual contamination finding\n1152\t    是 interesting insight， 可作为 discussion point 关于 contamination dynamics。 Reviewer\n1153\t    可能认为 +0.04 TPR 不值得 additional complexity； response 是 IFT 的价值在 qualitative insight（gradual\n1154\t    contamination）而非 quantitative gain。\n1155\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"76f689bc-835b-4f00-b32c-50d6308bc7dd","uuid":"2549c661-74d4-491c-8ca2-55901b8f5a8b","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:17:14.983Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T194223/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 调整为 \"DIF provides a complementary contamination signal\n  with unique RL-robustness properties\"， 强调程度差异而非 binary 生存。Claim 2 从三信号降级为双信号 + DVD\n  failure mode analysis。 Claim 3 限定为 within-subject equating pilot，讨论 acceptable degradation\n  bounds。 核心叙事从 \"self-healing benchmark\" 转向 \"psychometric monitoring framework with\n  contamination-aware recalibration\"。 需补充 2-3 个 ablation 实验填补 reviewer 攻击面。仍投 ICLR，但\n  related work 和 limitation 需加厚。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '在 METABENCH MMLU 响应矩阵（5,055 models × 12,508 items）上执行 DIF 分析。 按 release\n    date 划分 temporal cohorts（pre-2024 vs post-2024，以及更细的年度分割）。 对所有 items 运行 ETS C\n    DIF 检测，以 MMLU-CF 为部分 ground truth 做交叉验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_after_quality_filter: 4312\n    n_items_analyzable: 11847\n    cohort_pre2024_size: 2876\n    cohort_post2024_size: 1436\n    n_items_flagged_ets_c: 743\n    pct_items_flagged: 0.0627\n    dif_tpr_delta_ge_1.4_vs_mmlu_cf: 0.58\n    dif_tpr_delta_ge_1.0: 0.41\n    dif_fpr_clean_items: 0.062\n    mmlu_cf_correlation_spearman: 0.21\n    mmlu_cf_correlation_p_value: 0.003\n    n_items_delta_ge_1.4_estimated: 187\n    n_items_delta_1.0_to_1.4_estimated: 412\n    n_items_delta_lt_1.0_estimated: 144\n    ets_c_auc_vs_mmlu_cf_binary: 0.71\n    sensitivity_cohort_split_annual_tpr_range: 0.52-0.63\n    sensitivity_threshold_sweep_tpr_range: 0.44-0.67\n  result_rationale: 'Simulation 在 N=100, δ=1.4 下得到 TPR=0.758，但真实数据有三个系统性降级因素： (1)\n    真实 contamination effect sizes 不是均匀的 δ=1.4，多数 flagged items 落在 δ=1.0-1.4 的中间地带，\n    拉低了 aggregate TPR；(2) METABENCH 数据的 model heterogeneity（不同架构、不同 training recipe）\n    引入 DIF 分析假设之外的 noise，使得 IRT ability estimation 精度下降； (3) contamination 不是 binary\n    uniform 的——部分 models 只接触了 partial benchmark subsets， 创造了 fuzzy group boundaries\n    而非 simulation 中的 clean reference/focal split。 MMLU-CF correlation 为正但弱（ρ=0.21），因为\n    MMLU-CF 的 modification 并非针对 DIF 设计—— 它改变了 item 内容以消除记忆优势，但有些 modification 也改变了\n    difficulty， 引入了 false negatives（item 有 DIF 但 CF 版本 too different to count as same\n    construct）。 FPR 从 simulation 的 0.036-0.042 升至 0.062，因为 real data 中存在 non-contamination\n    来源的 DIF（如 certain model families 对特定 domain 有 architecture-driven advantages）。\n    δ≥1.4 的 items 仅占 flagged items 的约 25%，大部分 contamination signal 在 medium effect\n    区间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: DIF Detection Performance on MMLU by Effect Size Band'\n    columns:\n    - effect_size_band\n    - n_items_estimated\n    - ets_c_tpr\n    - ets_c_fpr\n    - mh_tpr\n    - lr_tpr\n    rows:\n    - - δ ≥ 1.6\n      - 68\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.058\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.61\n    - - δ ∈ [1.4, 1.6)\n      - 119\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.065\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.44\n    - - δ ∈ [1.0, 1.4)\n      - 412\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.063\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.33\n    - - δ ∈ [0.6, 1.0)\n      - 144\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.061\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.14\n    - - Clean (no contamination evidence)\n      - ~10400\n      - —\n      - 0.062\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 2: Sensitivity to Cohort Definition'\n    columns:\n    - cohort_split\n    - focal_n\n    - reference_n\n    - tpr_delta_ge_1.4\n    - fpr\n    - n_flagged\n    rows:\n    - - pre-2024 vs post-2024\n      - 1436\n      - 2876\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.062\n      - 743\n    - - pre-2023 vs post-2023\n      - 1891\n      - 2421\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.071\n      - 812\n    - - Annual (2022 vs 2024+)\n      - 987\n      - 1436\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.057\n      - 691\n    - - Quarterly (Q1-Q2 2023 vs Q3-Q4 2024)\n      - 623\n      - 718\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.084\n      - 658\n  - name: 'Table 3: MMLU-CF Cross-Validation'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - Spearman ρ (DIF effect size vs CF accuracy gap)\n      - 0.21\n      - '[0.09, 0.33]'\n    - - Items flagged by both DIF and CF\n      - 47\n      - —\n    - - Items flagged by DIF only\n      - 696\n      - —\n    - - Items flagged by CF only\n      - 83\n      - —\n    - - Cohen's κ (binary agreement)\n      - 0.14\n      - '[0.06, 0.22]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1: Scatter plot — DIF effect size (Δ_MH) vs MMLU-CF accuracy gap per item.\n    Weak positive trend (ρ=0.21) with substantial scatter. Color-coded by MMLU subject.\n    STEM items cluster slightly tighter; humanities items show more dispersion. Annotation:\n    items with high DIF but low CF gap likely reflect contamination patterns CF modification\n    did not capture (e.g., partial memorization of distractor patterns).'\n  - 'Figure 2: Histogram of estimated DIF effect sizes across all 12,508 items. Distribution\n    is right-skewed with long tail. Vertical lines at δ=0.6, 1.0, 1.4 thresholds.\n    Bulk of items (89%) below δ=0.6. Of flagged items, majority in δ=1.0-1.4 band,\n    not the δ≥1.4 band where DIF has strongest power.'\n  - 'Figure 3: ROC curves for DIF detection using MMLU-CF as noisy ground truth. ETS\n    C achieves AUC=0.71, MH AUC=0.64, LR AUC=0.68. Note: AUC is suppressed by ground\n    truth noise (CF ≠ perfect contamination label).'\n  analysis: '核心发现：DIF 在真实数据上有统计显著的 contamination 信号，但 power 比 simulation 低约 12-18pp。\n    主要瓶颈是 real contamination effect sizes 分布——δ≥1.4 的 items 仅占约 25%， 而 DIF 在 δ<1.0\n    区间的 power 不足以独立检测。 MMLU-CF 交叉验证提供了 directional support（p=0.003）但 agreement 较低（κ=0.14），\n    这既反映 DIF 的 imperfect power，也反映 CF 本身作为 ground truth 的局限性。 Cohort split sensitivity\n    分析显示：focal group 越小，FPR 升高（quarterly split 达 0.084）， 建议使用年度或更粗的 cohort 划分。 对 Claim\n    1 的影响：TPR=0.58 低于 paper framing 中承诺的 0.72-0.85 range， 需要将 claim 调整为 \"practical\n    detection of large effects\" 并明确 medium effect 的 coverage gap。 这个 gap 恰好为 ensemble（Claim\n    2）提供了动机。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '实证验证 DIF 的 RL-robustness。构建 SFT-only 和 SFT+RL 两种 cohort， 在两种场景下运行\n    DIF 和传统 detectors，量化 RL 对各方法的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_rl_models_identified_in_metabench: 23\n    n_rl_models_added_via_inference: 12\n    total_rl_models: 35\n    total_sft_only_models: 187\n    dif_tpr_sft_cohort_delta_ge_1.4: 0.61\n    dif_tpr_rl_cohort_delta_ge_1.4: 0.54\n    dif_power_retention_ratio: 0.885\n    mink_auroc_sft: 0.74\n    mink_auroc_rl: 0.51\n    mink_power_retention: 0.689\n    constat_auroc_sft: 0.69\n    constat_auroc_rl: 0.58\n    constat_power_retention: 0.841\n    dvd_auroc_sft: 0.62\n    dvd_auroc_rl: 0.56\n    dvd_power_retention: 0.903\n    dif_vs_best_traditional_gap_under_rl: 0.08\n    gpu_hours_used: 87\n  result_rationale: 'DIF 的 power retention ratio (0.885) 高于传统方法平均值，但 gap 不如理论预期那么\n    dramatic。 原因：(1) RL 训练确实平滑了 output distribution（Min-K% AUROC 从 0.74 降至 0.51， 与\n    Wang et al. 的 14-20pp degradation 一致），但 DIF 也受到了轻微影响—— RL 不仅平滑 output，还改变了 response\n    的 confidence calibration， 这通过 ability estimation 间接影响 DIF（IRT θ estimates 在 RL\n    models 上 less stable）。 (2) 传统方法在 RL 下并未完全退化到 random：ConStat AUROC=0.58（不是 0.50），\n    因为 perturbation sensitivity 虽然降低但未完全消失——RL 训练通常在 original format 上做 PPO， paraphrased\n    items 仍能 trip up 部分 RL models。 DVD 在 RL 下 AUROC=0.56，看似 retention 高（0.903），但 baseline\n    本身就低（0.62）， 说明 DVD 对这个 scenario 本身就不敏感而非 RL-robust。 最终 DIF vs best traditional\n    的 gap（在 RL 下 DIF TPR=0.54 vs ConStat AUROC=0.58） 不是 \"DIF 独活\" 的故事，而是 \"DIF 保持了 reasonable\n    power 且是 RL-robustness 最好的之一\"。 这要求将 narrative 从 \"only survivor\" 调整为 \"most robust\n    complement\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Detection Power Under SFT vs RL Training'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - auroc_sft\n    - auroc_rl\n    - retention_ratio\n    - Δ_auroc\n    rows:\n    - - DIF (ETS C)\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.885\n      - -0.05\n    - - Min-K%\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.689\n      - -0.23\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.746\n      - -0.18\n    - - ConStat (perturbation)\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.841\n      - -0.11\n    - - DVD (generation variance)\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.903\n      - -0.06\n    - - Perplexity ratio\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.49\n      - 0.731\n      - -0.18\n    - - Zlib ratio\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.881\n      - -0.07\n  - name: 'Table 5: DIF TPR Breakdown by RL Intensity'\n    columns:\n    - rl_category\n    - n_models\n    - dif_tpr_delta_ge_1.4\n    - mink_auroc\n    rows:\n    - - SFT only\n      - 187\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.74\n    - - Light RL (< 200 steps)\n      - 14\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.59\n    - - Heavy RL (≥ 200 steps)\n      - 21\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.47\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4: Grouped bar chart — AUROC by detection method, SFT vs RL cohorts. DIF\n    shows smallest absolute drop. Min-K% shows largest. Error bars from bootstrap.\n    Key visual: DIF bar heights nearly equal across groups; Min-K% and perplexity\n    bars drop sharply in RL group.'\n  - 'Figure 5: Power retention ratio plot — methods ranked by (AUROC_RL / AUROC_SFT).\n    DIF ranks 2nd (0.885) after DVD (0.903), but DVD''s baseline is too low to be\n    useful. Annotation: ''high retention on low baseline ≠ useful detection''.'\n  - 'Figure 6: Scatter — DIF effect size vs Min-K% score per item, colored by model\n    training type. SFT models show positive correlation; RL models show DIF signal\n    persisting while Min-K% collapses toward uniform.'\n  analysis: 'RL-robustness 存在但不 dramatic。DIF 的 retention ratio (0.885) 在所有方法中排名靠前，\n    但 ConStat (0.841) 也保持了 reasonable power，DVD retention 高但 baseline 低。 Median tier\n    下的故事不是 \"DIF 是唯一幸存者\"， 而是 \"DIF 提供了 RL-robust 且 complementary 的信号\"。 传统方法中 Min-K%\n    退化最严重（AUROC 0.51，接近 random）， 这与 Wang et al. 一致——output-distribution-based 方法对\n    RL 最脆弱。 但 performance-based 方法（ConStat）退化幅度小于预期。 Reviewer 可能攻击：(1) RL models 样本量小（n=35），统计\n    power 有限； (2) \"RL intensity\" 是 proxy 而非精确度量。 需在 paper 中 acknowledge 这些 limitations\n    并建议 future work 用 controlled RL fine-tuning 验证。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: '独立评估 ConStat-style perturbation testing 在 MMLU 上的 contamination 检测能力。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_reformulated: 248\n    n_models_tested: 42\n    reformulation_semantic_similarity_mean: 0.91\n    constat_tpr_non_rl_delta_ge_0.6: 0.47\n    constat_tpr_non_rl_delta_ge_1.0: 0.58\n    constat_tpr_non_rl_delta_ge_1.4: 0.64\n    constat_tpr_rl_models_delta_ge_0.6: 0.23\n    constat_tpr_rl_models_delta_ge_1.0: 0.31\n    constat_fdr_controlled_alpha_0.05: 0.048\n    constat_fdr_controlled_alpha_0.10: 0.087\n    n_items_detected_fdr_0.10: 89\n    overlap_with_dif_flags: 0.34\n    gpu_hours_used: 72\n  result_rationale: 'ConStat 在 non-RL models 上表现 reasonable（TPR=0.47 at δ≥0.6）， 因为\n    perturbation sensitivity 是 memorization 的 direct signal—— memorized items 的 reformulated\n    版本会导致 accuracy drop， 而 genuinely understood items 不会。这在 SFT models 上工作良好。 但 TPR\n    未达到 ConStat 原论文 claimed 的水平，原因是： (1) MMLU 是 multiple-choice，perturbation space\n    受限—— 改变 stem wording 可能改变 difficulty 而非仅测 memorization； (2) LLM reformulation\n    质量不均匀，部分 paraphrases 引入了 subtle meaning shifts， 增加了 noise。在 RL models 上 TPR 下降到\n    0.23（δ≥0.6）， 因为 RL 训练增强了 models 对 input perturbation 的 robustness（PPO reward hacking\n    的副效应）， 使得 perturbation sensitivity 信号被 masked。 与 DIF flags 的 overlap 为 0.34——两种方法检测不同的\n    contamination facets， DIF 捕捉 group-level behavioral shift，ConStat 捕捉 item-level\n    perturbation sensitivity， 这正好支持 ensemble 的 complementarity 论点。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: ConStat Detection Power by Effect Size and Model Type'\n    columns:\n    - effect_size_band\n    - tpr_non_rl\n    - tpr_rl\n    - tpr_all_models\n    rows:\n    - - δ ≥ 1.4\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.53\n    - - δ ∈ [1.0, 1.4)\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.48\n    - - δ ∈ [0.6, 1.0)\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.23\n      - 0.39\n    - - δ < 0.6\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.1\n  - name: 'Table 7: ConStat vs DIF Signal Overlap Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - category\n    - n_items\n    - pct_of_flagged\n    rows:\n    - - Flagged by both DIF and ConStat\n      - 31\n      - 34%\n    - - Flagged by DIF only\n      - 58\n      - 64%\n    - - Flagged by ConStat only\n      - 52\n      - 57%\n    - - Union (either method)\n      - 141\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 7: Venn diagram of DIF vs ConStat flagged items. Modest overlap (34%)\n    demonstrates complementarity rather than redundancy. Annotated with examples:\n    DIF-only items tend to be large-effect, RL-model-driven; ConStat-only items tend\n    to be medium-effect, SFT-model-driven.'\n  - 'Figure 8: ConStat detection power curve (TPR vs FDR threshold) for non-RL vs\n    RL model subsets. Non-RL curve substantially above RL curve, visualizing the RL\n    degradation. DIF power (horizontal reference line) shown for comparison.'\n  analysis: 'ConStat 是 ensemble 中可用的第二个信号。它在 non-RL 场景下提供了 DIF 的 complementary coverage，\n    尤其在 medium effect sizes（δ=0.6-1.4）——这恰好是 DIF 的 weak spot。 但 ConStat 在 RL 下 degradation\n    明显（TPR 从 0.47 降至 0.23）， 形成了与 DIF 的互补关系：DIF RL-robust 但需大 effect sizes，ConStat\n    覆盖 medium effects 但 RL-fragile。 两者 overlap 仅 34%，支持 ensemble 而非 redundancy。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: '独立评估 DVD generation variance 在 MMLU contamination detection 上的表现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_with_inference_access: 14\n    n_items_tested: 248\n    responses_per_item: 50\n    dvd_tpr_variant_contamination: 0.38\n    dvd_tpr_verbatim_contamination: 0.16\n    dvd_tpr_non_variant_all: 0.19\n    dvd_fpr: 0.094\n    dvd_auroc_overall: 0.57\n    bimodal_distribution_pct_items: 0.078\n    generation_variance_mean_clean: 0.42\n    generation_variance_mean_contaminated: 0.31\n    generation_variance_separation_cohens_d: 0.38\n    gpu_hours_used: 64\n  result_rationale: 'DVD 在 median tier 下是表现最弱的信号，降级 ensemble 从 3-signal 到 2-signal\n    的主要原因。 核心问题：MMLU 是 multiple-choice format，generation variance 的 signal 天然被压缩——\n    即使 model 记忆了答案，其 generation 仍然只是 output 一个 letter (A/B/C/D)， variance 空间极为有限。DVD\n    原设计针对 open-ended generation tasks， 在那里 memorized 内容会导致 deterministic long-form\n    output（低 variance）， 但 MMLU 的 forced-choice format 使得这个信号几乎消失。 Variant contamination（model\n    见过 rephrased version）确实产生了 slightly higher detection（TPR=0.38）， 因为 model 在 seen\n    variants 上的 confidence distribution 有异常—— 但这个 TPR 仍然不足以作为 reliable signal。 Verbatim\n    contamination 的 TPR 仅 0.16，因为 correct 答案的 generation variance 在 clean 和 contaminated\n    items 之间差异太小（Cohen''s d=0.38）。 FPR=0.094 偏高，接近 actionable threshold。 这些结果表明 DVD\n    在 MMLU-like benchmarks 上不适用， 但需在 paper 中分析 failure mode 并讨论其在 open-ended benchmarks\n    上的 potential。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: DVD Detection Performance on MMLU'\n    columns:\n    - contamination_type\n    - n_items\n    - tpr\n    - auroc\n    - cohen_d\n    rows:\n    - - Variant contamination\n      - 34\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.51\n    - - Verbatim contamination\n      - 89\n      - 0.16\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.29\n    - - Mixed/unknown\n      - 125\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.38\n    - - Clean items\n      - ~11600\n      - —(FPR=0.094)\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 9: Generation Variance Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - item_category\n    - mean_variance\n    - std\n    - median\n    rows:\n    - - Clean items\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.39\n    - - Contaminated (verbatim)\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.21\n      - 0.28\n    - - Contaminated (variant)\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.24\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 9: Distribution of generation variance scores for clean vs contaminated\n    items. Substantial overlap between distributions. Cohen''s d=0.38 indicates weak\n    separation. Contrast with DIF effect size distribution (Figure 2) to motivate\n    why DVD fails on multiple-choice format.'\n  - 'Figure 10: Per-model variance heatmap (14 models × 248 items). No clear bimodal\n    structure visible for most contaminated items. Bimodal pattern appears in only\n    7.8% of items — insufficient for reliable detection.'\n  analysis: 'DVD 是 ensemble 中 failed signal。Multiple-choice format 从根本上限制了 generation\n    variance 的信息量。 这不是 DVD method 本身的缺陷，而是 application domain mismatch。 Paper 中需要：(1)\n    清楚报告 DVD 的 failure 及 root cause analysis； (2) 讨论 DVD 可能在 open-ended benchmarks（如\n    HumanEval、MATH with free-form answers）上有效； (3) 作为 ablation study 之一，分析 format\n    dependence 对 detection signal 的影响。 这个 negative result 反而增强 paper 的 intellectual\n    honesty，reviewer 会 appreciate  对 failure mode 的 transparent analysis 而非 cherry-picking。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: '将 DIF + ConStat 融合为双信号 ensemble（DVD 降级为 ablation analysis）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ensemble_type: 2-signal (DIF + ConStat)\n    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_1.4_all: 0.73\n    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_1.0_all: 0.61\n    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_0.6_all: 0.48\n    ensemble_tpr_full_spectrum: 0.68\n    ensemble_fpr: 0.082\n    ensemble_tpr_rl_only_delta_ge_1.4: 0.59\n    ensemble_tpr_non_rl_delta_ge_0.6: 0.55\n    majority_voting_2of2_tpr: 0.34\n    majority_voting_1of2_tpr: 0.79\n    majority_voting_1of2_fpr: 0.11\n    weighted_fusion_optimal_tpr: 0.73\n    weighted_fusion_optimal_fpr: 0.082\n    dif_weight_in_fusion: 0.58\n    constat_weight_in_fusion: 0.42\n    ablation_dif_only_tpr: 0.58\n    ablation_constat_only_tpr: 0.47\n    ablation_add_dvd_tpr_gain: 0.02\n    coverage_analysis_dif_unique: 0.21\n    coverage_analysis_constat_unique: 0.18\n    coverage_analysis_overlap: 0.29\n  result_rationale: '2-signal ensemble 通过 complementarity 实现了比任一单信号更好的 coverage： DIF\n    覆盖 large effects + RL-robust，ConStat 覆盖 medium effects + non-RL， union coverage\n    高于单独使用任一方法。 Weighted fusion（DIF 0.58, ConStat 0.42）优于 simple voting， 因为 DIF 的\n    RL-robustness 使其在 mixed model population 中更 reliable。 2-of-2 voting 过于保守（TPR=0.34），因为两种方法检测的\n    contamination facet 不同—— 要求两者同时 flag 等于取 intersection 而非 union。 1-of-2 voting\n    FPR 偏高（0.11），因为 ConStat 的 FPR contribution。 Weighted fusion 在 TPR=0.73 / FPR=0.082\n    处取得最佳平衡。 加入 DVD 仅带来 +0.02 TPR gain，不值得增加 pipeline 复杂度， 证实了 2-signal 降级的合理性。 Ensemble\n    TPR=0.68（full spectrum）落在 median tier 指标范围 [0.6, 0.8] 内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Ensemble Fusion Strategy Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - strategy\n    - tpr_δ≥1.4\n    - tpr_δ≥0.6\n    - fpr\n    - f1\n    rows:\n    - - DIF only\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.062\n      - 0.47\n    - - ConStat only\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.087\n      - 0.51\n    - - 1-of-2 (union)\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.54\n    - - 2-of-2 (intersection)\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.031\n      - 0.37\n    - - Weighted fusion (optimal)\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.082\n      - 0.56\n  - name: 'Table 11: Coverage Analysis — What Each Signal Uniquely Detects'\n    columns:\n    - scenario\n    - dif_alone_detects\n    - constat_alone_detects\n    - both_detect\n    - neither_detects\n    rows:\n    - - Large effect + RL model\n      - ✓\n      - ✗\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Medium effect + SFT model\n      - ✗\n      - ✓\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Large effect + SFT model\n      - —\n      - —\n      - ✓\n      - —\n    - - Small effect (δ<0.6)\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - ✓\n  - name: 'Table 12: Ablation — Value of Each Signal in Ensemble'\n    columns:\n    - configuration\n    - tpr_full_spectrum\n    - Δ_vs_full_ensemble\n    rows:\n    - - DIF + ConStat (full)\n      - 0.68\n      - baseline\n    - - DIF only\n      - 0.58\n      - -0.1\n    - - ConStat only\n      - 0.47\n      - -0.21\n    - - DIF + ConStat + DVD\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.02\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 11: Coverage heatmap — rows are (effect size band × model type) cells,\n    columns are detection methods. Color intensity = TPR in that cell. Shows DIF strong\n    in upper-right (large effect, RL), ConStat strong in middle-left (medium effect,\n    SFT), both weak in lower region (small effects). Ensemble union covers more cells\n    than either alone.'\n  - 'Figure 12: Precision-Recall curves for single-signal vs ensemble approaches.\n    Ensemble curve dominates both individual curves, especially in the 0.4-0.7 recall\n    range where complementarity adds most value.'\n  - 'Figure 13: Ablation bar chart — TPR contribution of adding each signal. DIF→DIF+ConStat:\n    +0.10. DIF+ConStat→+DVD: +0.02. Diminishing returns visualized; motivates 2-signal\n    design choice.'\n  analysis: '2-signal ensemble 在 median tier 下是 pragmatic best result： full spectrum\n    TPR=0.68 说明 coverage 有显著 gaps（尤其 small effects + RL）， 但比任一单信号提升 10-21pp。 Paper\n    narrative 需强调 complementarity mechanism 而非 absolute performance， 并 honestly 报告\n    coverage holes。 DVD ablation 提供了 principled argument for 2-signal design， 同时 DVD\n    failure analysis 作为 Section 5.3 的 content。 Reviewer concern：FPR=0.082 接近 0.10\n    boundary，需讨论 false alarm cost 和 threshold tuning。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在 GSM8K 上复制 DIF 分析，使用 GSM1K 作为 contamination ground truth。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_gsm8k: 68\n    n_items_gsm8k: 1319\n    n_items_gsm1k: 1250\n    cohort_split: pre-2024 vs post-2024\n    focal_n: 31\n    reference_n: 37\n    n_items_dif_flagged_gsm8k: 127\n    pct_items_flagged_gsm8k: 0.096\n    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_mean_all_models: 0.073\n    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_mean_flagged_models: 0.118\n    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_dif_correlation: 0.22\n    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_correlation_p_value: 0.014\n    dif_tpr_vs_gsm1k_proxy: 0.49\n    dif_fpr_vs_gsm1k_proxy: 0.071\n    per_model_dif_flag_count_vs_gap_r: 0.31\n    gpu_hours_used: 83\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K 上的 DIF 分析面临更大挑战：(1) model sample size 更小（N=68 vs MMLU 的\n    4312）， 直接降低 statistical power；(2) GSM8K 是 math reasoning 而非 factual recall， contamination\n    pattern 不同——models 可能记忆了 solution patterns 而非 specific items， DIF 对 pattern-level\n    contamination 不如 item-level 敏感。 GSM8K-GSM1K gap correlation (ρ=0.22, p=0.014)\n    提供了独立验证 DIF 有 contamination 信号的证据， 但 correlation 弱于 MMLU-CF（ρ=0.21 对 ρ=0.22 看似接近，但\n    GSM1K 是更 clean 的 ground truth）， 反映了 math reasoning benchmark 上 contamination 形态的不同。\n    Per-model analysis（每个 model 被 flag 的 item count vs 其 GSM8K-GSM1K gap，r=0.31） 比\n    item-level correlation 更强，说明 DIF 在 model-level 上更有 discriminative power。 TPR=0.49\n    低于 MMLU 的 0.58，主要因为 sample size 和 effect size distribution 差异。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: GSM8K DIF Results Summary'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - Items flagged by DIF\n      - 127\n      - —\n    - - Mean GSM8K-GSM1K gap (all models)\n      - 7.3%\n      - '[5.1%, 9.5%]'\n    - - Mean gap (high DIF-flag-count models)\n      - 11.8%\n      - '[8.2%, 15.4%]'\n    - - Item-level DIF-gap correlation (ρ)\n      - 0.22\n      - '[0.06, 0.37]'\n    - - Model-level flag-count-gap correlation (r)\n      - 0.31\n      - '[0.14, 0.47]'\n  - name: 'Table 14: Cross-Benchmark Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_models\n    - n_items\n    - dif_tpr\n    - ground_truth_correlation\n    - fpr\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 4312\n      - 11847\n      - 0.58\n      - ρ=0.21 (MMLU-CF)\n      - 0.062\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 68\n      - 1319\n      - 0.49\n      - ρ=0.22 (GSM1K)\n      - 0.071\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 14: Scatter — per-model DIF flag count vs GSM8K-GSM1K accuracy gap. Positive\n    trend (r=0.31) with high variance. Models with >15 flagged items tend to have\n    larger gaps. Outliers annotated: some models with large gaps but few DIF flags\n    (pattern-level contamination DIF misses).'\n  - 'Figure 15: Side-by-side DIF effect size distributions for MMLU and GSM8K. GSM8K\n    distribution shifted left (smaller effects on average), consistent with math reasoning\n    contamination being subtler than factual knowledge contamination.'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K 结果提供了 complementary 但非 decisive 的验证。 ρ=0.22 是 statistically significant\n    但 practically weak 的 correlation。 主要价值是证明 DIF 在不同 benchmark domain（factual vs\n    reasoning）上都有 signal， 但 power 更低。Paper 中需讨论 math reasoning benchmarks 上 contamination\n    形态不同 （pattern memorization vs item memorization）作为 DIF power 下降的 explanation。\n    这个实验作为 supporting evidence 而非 standalone result。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '在 MMLU 上 pilot bifactor IRT equating：拟合 bifactor model，选择 anchor items，\n    通过 fixed-parameter calibration 校准 replacement items。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bifactor_model_converged: true\n    n_general_factor_loadings_gt_0.3: 9847\n    n_subject_factors: 57\n    subject_factor_variance_explained_range: 0.04-0.18\n    general_factor_variance_explained: 0.41\n    n_anchor_items_selected: 2340\n    anchor_item_dif_stability: 0.96\n    within_subject_equating_spearman_rho_mean: 0.93\n    within_subject_equating_rho_range: 0.89-0.97\n    cross_subject_equating_spearman_rho: 0.87\n    cross_subject_factor_instability_pct: 0.23\n    score_reliability_original: 0.89\n    score_reliability_equated_5pct_replaced: 0.87\n    score_reliability_equated_20pct_replaced: 0.82\n    equating_bias_mean: 0.003\n    equating_rmse: 0.047\n  result_rationale: 'Bifactor model 在 MMLU 上 converges 但 reveals structural heterogeneity：\n    general factor 仅解释 41% variance（低于典型 educational test 的 50-60%）， 因为 MMLU 覆盖 57\n    个 diverse subjects，跨 subject variance 大。 Within-subject equating 表现良好（mean ρ=0.93），因为\n    same-subject items 共享 factor structure， anchor items 稳定性高（stability=0.96）。 但 cross-subject\n    equating（ρ=0.87）低于 within-subject，因为 23% 的 subjects 的 factor structure 在不同 model\n    cohorts 间不稳定—— 即 model evolution 不仅改变了 ability level，也改变了 ability structure （某些\n    model families 在 STEM 上进步远快于 humanities）， violating bifactor model 的 factorial\n    invariance 假设。 ρ=0.93 在 within-subject 内可行但 ρ=0.87 cross-subject 不足以支持 \"全 benchmark\n    等值\" 的 claim。 这迫使 Claim 3 限定 scope 为 within-subject equating pilot。 Progressive\n    replacement 分析显示 5% 替换下 reliability 可接受（0.87）， 但 20% 替换时 reliability 降至 0.82，接近\n    practical minimum。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: Bifactor Model Fit Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - General factor variance explained\n      - 0.41\n    - - Mean subject-factor variance\n      - 0.09\n    - - RMSEA\n      - 0.038\n    - - CFI\n      - 0.94\n    - - TLI\n      - 0.92\n    - - Subjects with stable factor structure\n      - 44/57 (77%)\n  - name: 'Table 16: Equating Performance by Scope'\n    columns:\n    - scope\n    - spearman_rho\n    - equating_bias\n    - rmse\n    - n_items_replaced\n    rows:\n    - - Within-subject (STEM avg)\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.002\n      - 0.038\n      - 47\n    - - Within-subject (Humanities avg)\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.004\n      - 0.052\n      - 39\n    - - Within-subject (overall)\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.003\n      - 0.047\n      - 86\n    - - Cross-subject (full MMLU)\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.011\n      - 0.073\n      - 86\n  - name: 'Table 17: Score Reliability Under Progressive Replacement'\n    columns:\n    - pct_items_replaced\n    - reliability_α\n    - ranking_τ\n    - rho\n    rows:\n    - - 0% (baseline)\n      - 0.89\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.0\n    - - 5%\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.98\n      - 0.97\n    - - 10%\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.95\n    - - 20%\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.91\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.82\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 16: Within-subject equating scatter plots for 4 representative subjects.\n    Original vs equated model rankings. STEM subjects (physics, CS) show tighter fit;\n    humanities subjects (philosophy, history) show more scatter.'\n  - 'Figure 17: Reliability degradation curve — score reliability (Cronbach''s α equivalent)\n    vs percentage of items replaced. Horizontal dashed line at α=0.80 (acceptable\n    threshold). Crosses threshold between 20-30% replacement, suggesting practical\n    upper bound.'\n  - 'Figure 18: Subject-level factor stability analysis. Heatmap of factor loading\n    correlations across cohorts per subject. 23% of subjects show loading correlation\n    < 0.85, indicating structural instability.'\n  analysis: 'Within-subject equating 是 viable（ρ=0.93），但 cross-subject 不稳定（ρ=0.87）\n    限制了 full-benchmark equating 的 claim。 Paper 中需要：(1) 明确 scope 限制——Claim 3 rewrite\n    为 \"within-subject equating pilot\"； (2) 讨论 factor instability 的 root cause（model\n    capability evolution 非 uniform across domains）； (3) 提出 subject-specific equating\n    作为 practical deployment strategy。 Progressive replacement 结果提供了 practical guideline：5-10%\n    替换安全，20% 是 borderline， 50% 不可接受。这是有用的 contribution 即使 full equating 不完美。\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '为 DIF-flagged 的 MMLU items 生成替换 items，通过 student simulation 校准 difficulty。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_generated: 150\n    n_items_passing_quality_filter: 118\n    quality_filter_pass_rate: 0.787\n    difficulty_rho_prompt_based: 0.32\n    difficulty_rho_student_sim: 0.63\n    difficulty_rho_student_sim_within_subject: 0.68\n    discrimination_correlation: 0.41\n    construct_validity_factor_loading_mean: 0.38\n    construct_validity_factor_loading_original_mean: 0.47\n    difficulty_mae_prompt_based: 0.34\n    difficulty_mae_student_sim: 0.19\n    n_items_within_0.5_logit_of_target: 74\n    pct_items_within_0.5_logit: 0.627\n    gpu_hours_used: 178\n  result_rationale: 'Student simulation calibration（ρ=0.63）显著优于 prompt-based targeting（ρ=0.32），\n    因为 student simulation 通过实际 \"model population\" 响应来 estimate difficulty， 绕过了 LLM\n    self-assessment 的 calibration 问题。 但 ρ=0.63 低于 arXiv 2601.09953 reported 的 r=0.75-0.82，原因有二：\n    (1) 那篇论文的 evaluation 是 within-domain（同类型题目）， 而这里的 generated items 跨越了 57 subjects，domain\n    diversity 降低了 aggregate correlation； (2) MMLU items 的 difficulty 部分来自 distractor\n    quality， LLM generation 的 distractors 往往不如 human-crafted 的 effective， 导致 generated\n    items systematically easier（difficulty MAE=0.19 with slight easy-bias）。 Within-subject\n    ρ=0.68 高于 overall 的 0.63，说明 domain-specific generation 更 reliable。 Construct validity\n    是 soft spot：generated items 的 factor loadings（mean=0.38） 低于 original items（0.47），表明\n    generated items 与 underlying construct 的 alignment 较弱。 这 limits claim 强度——replacement\n    items 在 difficulty 上校准 acceptable， 但 construct validity 有 degradation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: Difficulty Calibration Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - ρ_overall\n    - ρ_within_subject\n    - mae\n    - n_within_0.5_logit\n    rows:\n    - - Prompt-based targeting\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.34\n      - 41/118 (35%)\n    - - Student simulation\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.19\n      - 74/118 (63%)\n    - - Student sim + iterative refinement\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.17\n      - 79/118 (67%)\n  - name: 'Table 19: Generated Item Quality Metrics'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - generated_items\n    - original_items\n    - gap\n    rows:\n    - - Mean difficulty (IRT b)\n      - -0.62\n      - -0.84\n      - +0.22 (easier)\n    - - Mean discrimination (IRT a)\n      - 0.93\n      - 1.2\n      - '-0.27'\n    - - Factor loading (general)\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.47\n      - '-0.09'\n    - - Distractor effectiveness\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.78\n      - '-0.17'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 19: Scatter — target difficulty (from DIF-flagged original item) vs achieved\n    difficulty (student simulation estimate). Prompt-based (left panel, ρ=0.32) vs\n    student sim (right panel, ρ=0.63). Student sim shows tighter fit with systematic\n    easy-bias visible as regression line below identity.'\n  - 'Figure 20: Histogram of difficulty calibration errors (|b_target - b_achieved|).\n    Student sim distribution shifted left relative to prompt-based. 63% of student\n    sim items within 0.5 logit of target (vs 35% for prompt-based).'\n  analysis: 'Student simulation calibration 是 viable 但 imperfect 的 difficulty estimation\n    method。 ρ=0.63 的 practical implication：about 2/3 of items 在 acceptable difficulty\n    range 内， 足够 support \"empirical calibration dramatically outperforms prompt-based\"\n    的 claim， 但不足以 claim \"precise psychometric replacement\"。 Construct validity gap（factor\n    loading 0.38 vs 0.47）是 paper 需要 honestly address 的 limitation—— generated items\n    测量了 approximately same construct 但不 identical。 Combined with equating results\n    (plan_005)，Claim 3 的叙事应为 \"pilot demonstration of calibrated regeneration with\n    known quality bounds\"。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '实现 cumulative Bayesian DIF priors，模拟 4 次连续 benchmark administrations，\n    展示 evidence accumulation 带来的 power improvement。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_administrations_simulated: 4\n    n_models_per_administration: 80\n    power_admin_1_medium_delta_1.0: 0.33\n    power_admin_2_cumulative: 0.48\n    power_admin_3_cumulative: 0.59\n    power_admin_4_cumulative: 0.66\n    power_admin_1_large_delta_1.4: 0.55\n    power_admin_4_large_delta_1.4_cumulative: 0.78\n    false_positive_rate_cumulative: 0.053\n    bayes_factor_threshold: 3.0\n    pct_items_reaching_bf_threshold_by_admin_4: 0.71\n  result_rationale: 'Bayesian accumulation 从 real-data 的 lower baseline 开始（而非 simulation\n    的 higher baseline）， 所以 single administration power 为 0.33（medium effect），低于 simulation\n    的 ~0.40。 但 accumulation dynamic 仍然 works：每次 administration 增加约 0.10-0.15 power，\n    到第 4 次达到 0.66——接近但未达到 simulation 预期的 0.70。 Gap 来自 real data 的 prior mis-specification：Bayesian\n    prior 假设 DIF effects  follow specific distribution，但真实 contamination 的 temporal\n    dynamics 不 stationary （某些 items 的 contamination 随时间变化，violating prior assumptions）。\n    FPR 保持在 0.053，说明 Bayesian framework 的 false alarm control 合理。 For large effects（δ=1.4），cumulative\n    power 达到 0.78（4 administrations）， 这是 paper 中值得 highlight 的 positive result——说明\n    \"patience pays off\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 20: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power Over Successive Administrations'\n    columns:\n    - administration\n    - n_models_cumulative\n    - power_δ=1.0\n    - power_δ=1.4\n    - fpr\n    rows:\n    - - '1'\n      - 80\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.048\n    - - '2'\n      - 160\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.051\n    - - '3'\n      - 240\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.052\n    - - '4'\n      - 320\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.053\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 21: Power accumulation curves — TPR vs number of administrations for δ=1.0\n    and δ=1.4. Both curves show diminishing-returns concave shape. δ=1.4 curve crosses\n    0.70 threshold by administration 3; δ=1.0 curve approaches but doesn''t reach\n    0.70 by administration 4. Extrapolation (dashed) suggests ~6 administrations needed\n    for δ=1.0 to reach 0.70.'\n  analysis: 'Bayesian accumulation 是 DIF power 不足问题的 temporal solution。 核心 message：单次检测\n    power 有限（0.33-0.55），但 monitoring framework  通过时间积累达到 useful power（0.66-0.78 at\n    4 administrations）。 这 directly supports \"psychometric monitoring framework\" 的\n    narrative reframing—— 不是 one-shot detection 而是 continuous monitoring。 但需要注意 practical\n    caveat：4 administrations 可能需要 1-2 年， 在此期间 contamination 已经对 benchmark validity\n    造成了 damage。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '分析 benchmark validity 在 progressive item replacement 下的 graceful degradation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    replacement_rates_tested:\n    - 0.05\n    - 0.1\n    - 0.15\n    - 0.2\n    - 0.3\n    - 0.5\n    ranking_stability_kendall_tau_5pct: 0.97\n    ranking_stability_kendall_tau_10pct: 0.95\n    ranking_stability_kendall_tau_20pct: 0.91\n    ranking_stability_kendall_tau_50pct: 0.81\n    score_reliability_cronbach_5pct: 0.87\n    score_reliability_cronbach_10pct: 0.85\n    score_reliability_cronbach_20pct: 0.82\n    score_reliability_cronbach_50pct: 0.74\n    construct_coverage_jaccard_5pct: 0.97\n    construct_coverage_jaccard_20pct: 0.89\n    construct_coverage_jaccard_50pct: 0.76\n    theoretical_upper_bound_replacement_rate: 0.25\n    practical_recommended_max: 0.15\n    equating_error_propagation_rmse_10pct: 0.041\n    equating_error_propagation_rmse_20pct: 0.068\n  result_rationale: 'Graceful degradation 分析显示 benchmark validity 在 low replacement\n    rates 下 well-preserved， 但在 >20% 时快速衰退。这符合 psychometric theory：test reliability\n    近似为 Spearman-Brown 函数， each replaced item 引入 calibration error（plan_006 显示 difficulty\n    ρ=0.63）， error 随 replacement rate 线性累积但 validity impact 呈 nonlinear degradation。\n    15% replacement 是 practical sweet spot：ranking stability (τ=0.93) 和 reliability\n    (α=0.84)  都在 acceptable range，且涵盖了 plan_001 中约 80% 的 δ≥1.0 flagged items。 50%\n    replacement 的 reliability 降至 0.74，低于 psychometric 标准的 0.80 threshold—— 这是 \"benchmark\n    不再可比\" 的 hard boundary。 Theoretical analysis 给出 upper bound 25%（在 perfect calibration\n    假设下）， 但 plan_006 的 imperfect calibration 将实际 limit 压到 15%。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 21: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n    columns:\n    - replacement_rate\n    - kendall_τ\n    - cronbach_α\n    - construct_jaccard\n    - equating_rmse\n    rows:\n    - - 0% (baseline)\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.89\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.0\n    - - 5%\n      - 0.97\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.97\n      - 0.029\n    - - 10%\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.041\n    - - 15%\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.054\n    - - 20%\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.068\n    - - 30%\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.091\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.132\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 22: Multi-panel degradation curves — kendall τ, cronbach α, construct\n    coverage vs replacement rate. All three metrics show concave degradation pattern.\n    Shaded regions indicate ''safe'' (<15%), ''caution'' (15-25%), and ''unacceptable''\n    (>25%) zones. Vertical dashed lines at 15% (practical) and 25% (theoretical) bounds.'\n  - 'Figure 23: Equating error propagation — RMSE of equated scores vs replacement\n    rate. Near-linear growth up to 20%, then acceleration. Error bars from bootstrap\n    (100 resamples).'\n  analysis: 'This experiment 提供了 Claim 3 最重要的 practical guideline： up to 15% item\n    replacement 维持 acceptable validity，这足以处理大部分 contamination。 Paper 应将此 frame 为 \"known\n    operating envelope\" 而非 limitation—— psychometric maturity 在于知道方法的 validity bounds，而非声称无限\n    scalability。 Theoretical vs practical bound gap（25% vs 15%）由 item generation quality\n    驱动， 指向 future work：improve generation quality → expand operating envelope。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '实现 Item-Focused Trees 作为 categorical cohort DIF 的替代方案， 将 model release\n    date 作为连续 covariate。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_analyzed: 11847\n    n_items_significant_ift: 891\n    ift_tpr_delta_ge_1.4: 0.62\n    ift_tpr_delta_ge_1.0: 0.46\n    ift_fpr: 0.058\n    ift_vs_ets_c_tpr_gain: 0.04\n    ift_vs_ets_c_fpr_reduction: 0.004\n    ift_detected_gradual_contamination_items: 134\n    ift_split_point_mode_month: 2023-09\n    ift_computational_time_minutes: 47\n  result_rationale: 'Item-Focused Trees 提供了 modest improvement over categorical DIF（TPR\n    +0.04, FPR -0.004）， 因为它避免了 arbitrary cohort splits 导致的 information loss—— 连续 covariate\n    保留了 release date 的 full ordering information。 但 improvement 幅度有限，因为 contamination\n    在时间上确实是 roughly step-function-like （一旦 benchmark 被 widely available，contamination\n    快速 saturates）， 使得 continuous treatment 的 marginal benefit 小。 IFT 的独特贡献是发现了 134\n    个 \"gradual contamination\" items—— 这些 items 的 DIF effect size 随时间平滑增长而非 suddenly\n    appear， 对应 incremental leakage pattern。这在 categorical DIF 中不可见。 Split point mode\n    在 2023-09，大致对应 MMLU 进入 mainstream LLM training data 的时间点。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 22: IFT vs Categorical DIF Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - tpr_δ≥1.4\n    - tpr_δ≥1.0\n    - fpr\n    - unique_detections\n    rows:\n    - - ETS C (categorical)\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.062\n      - 47\n    - - IFT (continuous)\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.46\n      - 0.058\n      - 134\n    - - Overlap (both detect)\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 612\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 24: Item-level contamination onset timeline. X-axis: model release date.\n    Y-axis: IFT-estimated DIF effect size. Each line represents one item. Most items\n    show step-function pattern (sudden onset); 134 items show gradual ramp (linear\n    increase). Vertical dashed line at 2023-09.'\n  analysis: IFT 是 useful methodological extension 但非 game-changer。 Paper 中作为 robustness\n    check 和 methodological contribution（Section 4.x）。 Gradual contamination finding\n    是 interesting insight， 可作为 discussion point 关于 contamination dynamics。 Reviewer\n    可能认为 +0.04 TPR 不值得 additional complexity； response 是 IFT 的价值在 qualitative insight（gradual\n    contamination）而非 quantitative gain。\n","numLines":1155,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1155}}}
