{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JBAWmFi4ZkvXV6WQLbGPAm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: worst\n2\tnarrative_guidance: '核心\"DIF是RL-robust contamination signal\"假设不成立。5000+异构模型的response\n3\t  matrix严重违反IRT unidimensionality假设，architecture差异（encoder-only vs decoder-only vs\n4\t  MoE）制造了大量 spurious DIF，FPR膨胀至实用边界之外。真实contamination以partial memorization为主， ICC\n5\t  shift不足以在高噪声背景下被检出。RL-robustness优势不显著——传统方法在RL下虽然退化， 但DIF也退化，差距不足以支撑\"orthogonal\n6\t  signal\"叙事。需要pivot到negative-result framing 或剥离Claim 3做独立贡献。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n11\t  plan_id: plan_001\n12\t  description: '对METABENCH MMLU response matrix (5,055 models × 12,508 items)执行temporal\n13\t    cohort DIF分析， 以MMLU-CF为partial ground truth验证。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    dif_tpr_delta_ge_1.4: 0.38\n18\t    dif_tpr_delta_ge_1.0: 0.18\n19\t    dif_fpr: 0.12\n20\t    mmlu_cf_correlation_with_dif_flags_phi: 0.09\n21\t    mmlu_cf_correlation_with_dif_flags_spearman: 0.07\n22\t    irt_model_fit_rmsea: 0.11\n23\t    irt_model_fit_cfi: 0.78\n24\t    n_items_flagged_ets_c: 1840\n25\t    n_items_flagged_ets_c_after_fpr_correction: 620\n26\t    cohort_size_pre2024: 1850\n27\t    cohort_size_post2024: 3205\n28\t    unidimensionality_test_p: 0.001\n29\t    item_discrimination_variance: 2.8\n30\t  result_rationale: '5055个模型跨越encoder-only (BERT-family)、decoder-only (GPT/LLaMA family)、MoE等根本不同\n31\t    的architecture，对MMLU items的response pattern受architecture驱动而非ability驱动。例如 decoder-only模型在long-context\n32\t    reasoning items上系统性优于encoder-only模型，这与contamination 无关但产生大量DIF。RMSEA=0.11远超可接受阈值(0.06)，CFI=0.78低于0.90标准，表明unidimensional\n33\t    IRT model严重misfit。在此背景下ETS C的effect-size threshold无法区分architecture-driven DIF\n34\t    和contamination-driven DIF，导致FPR膨胀至0.12。1840个items被flagged（15%的item pool）， 其中大部分是false\n35\t    positives。与MMLU-CF的correlation仅phi=0.09，接近random——因为MMLU-CF 本身的contamination annotation也有噪声（它只标注了\"显著修改\"的items，但并未验证原始items\n36\t    确实被contaminated），加上DIF flags被spurious signal淹没，两个noisy signal之间几乎无相关。\n37\t\n38\t    '\n39\t  tables:\n40\t  - title: 'Table 1: DIF Detection Performance on METABENCH MMLU (Worst Tier)'\n41\t    columns:\n42\t    - metric\n43\t    - pre2024_vs_post2024\n44\t    - annual_cohorts\n45\t    - sliding_window_6mo\n46\t    rows:\n47\t    - - TPR_delta_ge_1.4\n48\t      - 0.38\n49\t      - 0.31\n50\t      - 0.28\n51\t    - - TPR_delta_ge_1.0\n52\t      - 0.18\n53\t      - 0.14\n54\t      - 0.12\n55\t    - - FPR\n56\t      - 0.12\n57\t      - 0.14\n58\t      - 0.15\n59\t    - - F1_delta_ge_1.4\n60\t      - 0.33\n61\t      - 0.28\n62\t      - 0.25\n63\t    - - N_flagged_items\n64\t      - 1840\n65\t      - 2100\n66\t      - 2350\n67\t    - - MMLU-CF_phi_correlation\n68\t      - 0.09\n69\t      - 0.07\n70\t      - 0.06\n71\t  - title: 'Table 2: IRT Model Fit Diagnostics'\n72\t    columns:\n73\t    - fit_index\n74\t    - value\n75\t    - acceptable_threshold\n76\t    - verdict\n77\t    rows:\n78\t    - - RMSEA\n79\t      - 0.11\n80\t      - ≤0.06\n81\t      - FAIL\n82\t    - - CFI\n83\t      - 0.78\n84\t      - ≥0.90\n85\t      - FAIL\n86\t    - - TLI\n87\t      - 0.74\n88\t      - ≥0.90\n89\t      - FAIL\n90\t    - - SRMR\n91\t      - 0.09\n92\t      - ≤0.08\n93\t      - FAIL\n94\t    - - M2_p_value\n95\t      - <0.001\n96\t      - '>0.05'\n97\t      - FAIL\n98\t  figures_description:\n99\t  - 'Fig 1: ICC overlay of 20 highest-DIF items — curves show chaotic crossing patterns\n100\t    rather than clean uniform/non-uniform DIF, suggesting architecture heterogeneity"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01R52wX4HzvABdpZTN6s9xM8","session_id":"76f689bc-835b-4f00-b32c-50d6308bc7dd","uuid":"72644a5e-0fd9-4669-9c15-7c0b696be38f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:18:28.305Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017edogTdYDXsCDz9wi7BwDp","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 irt_equated_bench_regen 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (2 个)\\n\\n- **mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_dif_power_sim**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-20\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2** (success): ETS C 分类在 METABENCH 真实 MMLU 2PL IRT 参数（非理想化分布）下，仍能在 N≥80/group、δ≥1.4 时达到 TPR≥0.65、FPR≤0.10。Phase 1 用合成参数（a~LogNormal, b~N(0,1)）条件性通过，需验证真实参数分布（可能有偏态、聚集、极端值）不会降解检测功效。 ← 基于 mvp_dif_power_sim\\n- **mvp_dif_power_sim** (success): DIF 跨模型批次分析（MH + Logistic Regression）在 N=50-80/group、污染效应量 δ≥1.0 logits 时，对 10% 污染 items 的检测功效 TPR≥0.70 且 FPR≤0.10。这是整个 pipeline 的前提假设——若 DIF 在理想合成数据上都 underpowered，则后续真实数据方案不成立。\\n  [Phase 1 DIF Power Results CSV](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/mvp_dif_power_sim/data/dif_power_results.csv) | [Phase 1 DIF Power Curves](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/mvp_dif_power_sim/chart/dif_power_curves.pdf) | [DIF Diagnostic P-value Distribution](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/mvp_dif_power_sim/chart/dif_diagnostic_pvalue_dist.pdf) | [DIF Diagnostic TPR Comparison (Raw vs BH vs Bonferroni)](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/mvp_dif_power_sim/data/dif_diagnostic_tpr_comparison.csv)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 2 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\nbest_auc_lr: 0.9405 ↓（近 2 次 success）\\nbest_auc_mh: 0.9254 ↓（近 2 次 success）\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\n（无服务器配置）\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015FEHePcSyc57L2eyTesg2t","session_id":"76f689bc-835b-4f00-b32c-50d6308bc7dd","uuid":"f77c6726-b57e-43b7-86bb-8278915072e6","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:18:28.326Z"}
