{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EqG4tQttoF4jNzGaSfEoBM","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2** (success): ETS C 分类在 METABENCH 真实 MMLU 2PL IRT 参数（非理想化分布）下，仍能在 N≥80/group、δ≥1.4 时达到 TPR≥0.65、FPR≤0.10。Phase 1 用合成参数（a~LogNormal, b~N(0,1)）条件性通过，需验证真实参数分布（可能有偏态、聚集、极端值）不会降解检测功效。 ← 基于 mvp_dif_power_sim\\\\n- **mvp_dif_power_sim** (success): DIF 跨模型批次分析（MH + Logistic Regression）在 N=50-80/group、污染效应量 δ≥1.0 logits 时，对 10% 污染 items 的检测功效 TPR≥0.70 且 FPR≤0.10。这是整个 pipeline 的前提假设——若 DIF 在理想合成数据上都 underpowered，则后续真实数据方案不成立。\\\\n  [Phase 1 DIF Power Results CSV](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/mvp_dif_power_sim/data/dif_power_results.csv) | [Phase 1 DIF Power Curves](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/mvp_dif_power_sim/chart/dif_power_curves.pdf) | [DIF Diagnostic P-value Distribution](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/mvp_dif_power_sim/chart/dif_diagnostic_pvalue_dist.pdf) | [DIF Diagnostic TPR Comparison (Raw vs BH vs Bonferroni)](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/mvp_dif_power_sim/data/dif_diagnostic_tpr_comparison.csv)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 2 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\\\nbest_auc_lr: 0.9405 ↓（近 2 次 success）\\\\nbest_auc_mh: 0.9254 ↓（近 2 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\n（无服务器配置）\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1333, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015FEHePcSyc57L2eyTesg2t","session_id":"76f689bc-835b-4f00-b32c-50d6308bc7dd","uuid":"9bc82a45-cf2